E("2026-10-21", "statement", "Gustale denies indirect financing of the portfolio sale", "Gustale niega la financiación indirecta de la venta de cartera", "Ueno president Juan Manuel Gustale says the bank complies with related-party limits after fixing a June breach in time, is cooperating with the BCP investigation, and disputes that there was indirect financing.", "El presidente de Ueno, Juan Manuel Gustale, dice que el banco cumple los límites con vinculadas tras corregir en plazo un exceso de junio, que coopera con la investigación del BCP y niega que haya habido financiación indirecta.", [GUST, UB], P("company", BB21, "regulatory scrutiny", "Sostenemos que no la hubo", "high", "Pre-collapse position of the bank's president; publication date used (interview date not given). Counterpart to the prosecution's Vinanzas allegation."))
E("2026-10-22", "criminal", "ABC: cash requests of G. 480 million and G. 1,500 million marked 'pedido MV'", "ABC: pedidos de efectivo de G. 480 millones y G. 1.500 millones marcados 'pedido MV'", "ABC reports requests of 22 October 2026 for G. 480 million (replenishment) and G. 1,500 million (new request) to be available the same day, annotated as a request from 'MV'.", "ABC informa de requerimientos del 22 de octubre de 2026 por G. 480 millones (reposición) y G. 1.500 millones (solicitud nueva) para el mismo día, anotados como 'pedido MV'.", [GV, MV], P("press", BOLS, "22 Oct item", "pedido MV", "low", "Single outlet based on leaked documents; attribution of 'MV' to Miguel Vázquez is the outlet's reading; no response from him is reported. " + NOALLEG), 1500000000, "PYG")
