E("2026-11-02", "supervisory", "BCP board unanimously orders the resolution of ueno bank", "El directorio del BCP dispone por unanimidad la resolución de ueno bank", "The BCP board decides unanimously to open the resolution procedure under Law 2.334/03 after finding a solvency ratio below 50% of the required minimum, attributed to adjustments to the financial statements during the regularisation process.", "El directorio del BCP resuelve por unanimidad iniciar el procedimiento de resolución bajo la Ley 2.334/03 tras constatar un índice de solvencia inferior al 50 % del mínimo requerido, atribuido a ajustes a los estados financieros durante el proceso de regularización.", [BCP, UB], P("regulator", LN3, "body", "por debajo del cincuenta por ciento (50 %) del mínimo requerido", "high", "This article gives no resolution number. Several foreign outlets date the measure to 3 Nov (day of announcement)."))
E("2026-11-02", "supervisory", "BCP Resolution N.º 1 cited in the charges (art. 13 b, Law 2334/03)", "Resolución N.º 1 del BCP citada en la imputación (art. 13 inc. b, Ley 2334/03)", "La Nación's account of the charges cites Resolution N.º 1 of the BCP board, dated 2 November 2026, ordering the start of the resolution under article 13(b) of Law 2334/03.", "El relato de La Nación sobre la imputación cita la Resolución N.º 1 del directorio del BCP, del 2 de noviembre de 2026, que dispone el inicio de la resolución con base en el artículo 13 inciso b) de la Ley 2334/03.", [BCP, UB], P("press", LN4, "BCP resolution paragraph", "", "medium", "Only this article gives the resolution number."))
E("2026-11-02", "supervisory", "Reported ratios: 13.85% reported, 12% minimum, 5.56% after adjustments", "Ratios informados: 13,85 % reportado, 12 % mínimo, 5,56 % tras ajustes", "5Días reports a Tier II capital ratio of 13.85% against a 12% minimum and 5.56% after supervisory adjustments, with a provisions deficit of G. 1.62 trillion.", "5Días informa un ratio de capital de 13,85 % frente al mínimo del 12 % y de 5,56 % tras los ajustes de supervisión, con un déficit de previsiones de G. 1,62 billones.", [BCP, UB], P("press", D5, "4 Nov edition figures", "", "medium", "Independiente gives the provisioning adjustment as G. 1,621,853,458,972 and cautions it is not by itself a proven loss."), 1621853458972, "PYG")
E("2026-11-03", "supervisory", "Moody's and others date the start of the resolution to 3 November", "Moody's y otros fechan el inicio de la resolución el 3 de noviembre", "Expansión, summarising Moody's, says the central bank began resolving Ueno Bank on 3 November.", "Expansión, resumiendo a Moody's, dice que el banco central inició la resolución de Ueno Bank el 3 de noviembre.", [BCP, UB, "org:moodys"], P("press", "src:expansion-2026-11-06-moodys", "key facts", "", "medium", "Conflict on date: La Nación, 5Días, AP and Reuters give the board decision as 2 Nov, announced in the early hours of 3 Nov."))
E("2026-11-03", "supervisory", "BCP announces the resolution; operations suspended; press conference at 07:00", "El BCP anuncia la resolución; operaciones suspendidas; conferencia a las 07:00", "The BCP issues its communiqué in the early hours and holds a press conference at 07:00. BCP president Carlos Carvallo calls the process the result of several months of technical work. Cards, apps and other channels are suspended; the exclusion balance has a legal deadline of up to 15 days.", "El BCP emite su comunicado de madrugada y da una conferencia a las 07:00. El presidente del BCP, Carlos Carvallo, dice que el proceso es resultado de varios meses de trabajo técnico. Se suspenden tarjetas, aplicaciones y otros canales; el balance de exclusión tiene un plazo legal de hasta 15 días.", [BCP, UB, CARV], P("regulator", "src:revistafoco-2026-11-03-alcance", "press conference", "varios meses de trabajo técnico", "high"))
E("2026-11-03", "depositor", "Deposit guarantee of G. 228.3 million per depositor; first payment of up to G. 10 million", "Garantía de depósitos de G. 228,3 millones por depositante; primer pago de hasta G. 10 millones", "The guarantee covers up to 75 monthly minimum wages (G. 228,300,000) per person and institution; about 97% of depositors are estimated to be fully covered; an initial payment of up to G. 10 million net of debts is announced.", "La garantía cubre hasta 75 salarios mínimos mensuales (G. 228.300.000) por persona y entidad; se estima que cerca del 97 % de los depositantes queda totalmente cubierto; se anuncia un pago inicial de hasta G. 10 millones neto de deudas.", [FGD, BCP, UB], P("press", AP, "customers and deposits"), 228300000, "PYG")
E("2026-11-03", "supervisory", "Carvallo signs his resignation but stays to oversee the takeover", "Carvallo firma su renuncia pero permanece para acompañar la resolución", "AP reports that the BCP president signed his resignation at Peña's request but would stay to oversee the takeover, and that the regulator says he had recused himself from decisions on Ueno.", "AP informa que el presidente del BCP firmó su renuncia a pedido de Peña pero seguiría para acompañar el proceso, y que según el regulador se había excusado de las decisiones sobre Ueno.", [CARV, BCP, PENA], P("press", AP, "central bank chief", "the central bank needs calm to do its job"))
E("2026-11-03", "statement", "Peña: those responsible will answer to the courts", "Peña: los responsables responderán ante la Justicia", "The then president cancels a trip, asks Carvallo to resign and writes that those responsible will have to answer to the courts without exceptions or privileges.", "El entonces presidente cancela un viaje, pide la renuncia de Carvallo y escribe que los responsables deberán responder ante la Justicia sin excepciones ni privilegios.", [PENA], P("press", AP, "President Peña", "", "high", "Statement by then-president Peña as reported by AP (English translation in source)."))
E("2026-11-03", "criminal", "BCP files a criminal complaint; 120 interveners designated", "El BCP presenta denuncia penal; se designan 120 interventores", "The BCP files its complaint with the Ministerio Público in the morning; Hoy reports 120 interveners designated.", "El BCP presenta su denuncia ante el Ministerio Público por la mañana; Hoy informa la designación de 120 interventores.", [BCP, MP, UB], P("press", "src:hoy-2026-11-03-ordenan-detencion", "body"))
E("2026-11-03", "criminal", "BCP complaint as reported: unsecured related-party loans, rolling overdrafts and a simulated portfolio sale", "Denuncia del BCP según lo publicado: créditos a vinculadas sin garantías, sobregiros continuos y venta de cartera simulada", "Per Hoy, the complaint alleges signature-only loans of up to ten years to group companies, permanent overdrafts covered with 3-day cheques or new loans, onward transfers to ITTI, REDISA and REDIPRO, and a simulated USD 74.4 million sale to Vinanzas funded through same-day loans to Satec S.A. and HD Invest E.A.S.", "Según Hoy, la denuncia alega créditos a sola firma de hasta diez años a empresas del grupo, sobregiros permanentes cubiertos con cheques a 3 días o nuevos préstamos, transferencias posteriores a ITTI, REDISA y REDIPRO, y una venta simulada de USD 74,4 millones a Vinanzas financiada con créditos del mismo día a Satec S.A. y HD Invest E.A.S.", [BCP, UB, "org:vinanzas", "org:satec", "org:hd-invest", "org:itti", "org:redisa", "org:redipro", "org:mowi", "org:grupo-hendy", "org:grupo-m", "org:franede"], P("regulator", "src:hoy-2026-11-04-denuncia-bcp", "summary of the complaint", "una sola unidad de riesgo que el banco ocultó", "medium", NOALLEG + " Complaint as summarised by one outlet (published 4 Nov)."), 74400000, "USD")
E("2026-11-03", "criminal", "Fiscalía orders the detention of eight bank directors (Hoy: resolution N.º 4393)", "La Fiscalía ordena la detención de ocho directivos (Hoy: resolución N.º 4393)", "Hoy reports that the Fiscalía ordered the detention of eight directors by resolution N.º 4393 for alleged breach of trust and other offences.", "Hoy informa que la Fiscalía ordenó la detención de ocho directivos mediante la resolución N.º 4393 por presunta lesión de confianza y otros hechos punibles.", EIGHT + [MP], P("press", "src:hoy-2026-11-03-ordenan-detencion", "body", "", "medium", "Conflict on the document: ABC cites Nota N.º 01 of 3 Nov 2026 in Causa 89/2026. Hoy spells one name 'Mariano Torres Rubiani'."))
E("2026-11-03", "criminal", "Detention order: Nota N.º 01 in Causa 89/2026 (ABC)", "Orden de detención: Nota N.º 01 en la Causa 89/2026 (ABC)", "ABC reports that Nota N.º 01 of the Ministerio Público, dated 3 November 2026, in Causa 89/2026 orders the immediate detention of eight people.", "ABC informa que la Nota N.º 01 del Ministerio Público, del 3 de noviembre de 2026, en la Causa 89/2026 ordena la detención inmediata de ocho personas.", EIGHT + [MP], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-03-vazquez-se-entrego", "detention order", "", "high", "Conflict on the document: Hoy cites 'resolución nro. 4393'."))
E("2026-11-03", "criminal", "Miguel Vázquez presents himself to the police", "Miguel Vázquez se presenta ante la Policía", "Vázquez presents himself in the afternoon at the Investigations Department of the National Police in Asunción. ABC lists six other directors as in custody while giving the count as six in total.", "Vázquez se presenta por la tarde en el Departamento de Investigaciones de la Policía Nacional en Asunción. ABC lista a otros seis directivos como detenidos, aunque da un total de seis.", [MV], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-03-vazquez-se-entrego", "body", "", "high", "ABC's count of detainees is internally inconsistent (six vs seven names); Almada's detention is not confirmed in that article."))
E("2026-11-03", "statement", "Vázquez's lawyer: he came voluntarily on learning of the order", "Abogado de Vázquez: se presentó voluntariamente al conocer la orden", "Lawyer Víctor Dante Gulino says his client came voluntarily after learning of the order through the media and that the defence does not yet have details of the case.", "El abogado Víctor Dante Gulino dice que su cliente se presentó voluntariamente al enterarse de la orden por los medios y que la defensa aún no maneja detalles de la causa.", [MV, "person:victor-dante-gulino"], P("defence", "src:abc-2026-11-03-vazquez-se-entrego", "lawyer's statements", "vino voluntariamente, al conocer la noticia"))
E("2026-11-03", "criminal", "Board members under investigation as listed by Telefuturo; International Affairs unit involved", "Directivos investigados según Telefuturo; interviene Asuntos Internacionales", "Telefuturo lists Gustale, Vázquez, Mongelós, Gómez Abente and Duarte Schussmuller plus three directors and an alternate who were not later charged, and says the International Affairs unit under Manuel Doldán is involved because of bonds and investments placed abroad.", "Telefuturo lista a Gustale, Vázquez, Mongelós, Gómez Abente y Duarte Schussmuller, además de tres directores y una suplente que luego no fueron imputados, e indica que interviene Asuntos Internacionales, a cargo de Manuel Doldán, por bonos e inversiones colocados en el exterior.", [MP, "person:manuel-doldan", GUST, MV, "person:diana-mongelos", "person:alejandro-gomez-abente", "person:diego-duarte"], P("press", "src:telefuturo-2026-11-03-directivos", "body", "", "medium", "The list differs from the eight later charged; persons not charged are not named here."))
E("2026-11-03", "criminal", "First prosecution team designated", "Designación del primer equipo fiscal", "The Attorney General designates anti-corruption prosecutors Francisco Cabrera, Silvio Corbeta, Jorge Arce and Yeimy Adle under deputy attorney general Nancy Salomón; preliminary framing: breach of trust, fraud and conduct leading to bankruptcy.", "El fiscal general designa a los fiscales anticorrupción Francisco Cabrera, Silvio Corbeta, Jorge Arce y Yeimy Adle bajo la coordinación de la fiscal adjunta Nancy Salomón; encuadre preliminar: lesión de confianza, estafa y conducta conducente a la quiebra.", [MP, "person:emiliano-rolon", "person:francisco-cabrera", "person:silvio-corbeta", "person:jorge-arce", "person:yeimy-adle", "person:nancy-salomon"], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-03-embargo", "criminal investigation"))
E("2026-11-03", "criminal", "Civil court orders a preventive embargo of USD 70 million plus G. 1.6 trillion", "Juzgado civil dicta embargo preventivo por USD 70 millones más G. 1,6 billones", "At the BCP's request, civil and commercial judge Walter Mendoza orders a preventive embargo for USD 70 million, G. 1.6 trillion for the deficit and over G. 58 million in costs against U Paraguay SA, U Holdings SARL, Grupo Vázquez SAE, the beneficial owner and six directors.", "A pedido del BCP, el juez civil y comercial Walter Mendoza dicta embargo preventivo por USD 70 millones, G. 1,6 billones por el déficit y más de G. 58 millones de gastos contra U Paraguay SA, U Holdings SARL, Grupo Vázquez SAE, el beneficiario final y seis directivos.", [BCP, "person:walter-mendoza", "auth:juzgado-civil-comercial-8", "org:u-paraguay", "org:u-holdings", GV, MV, GUST, "person:diana-mongelos", "person:alejandro-gomez-abente", "person:diego-duarte"], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-03-embargo", "body", "", "high", "The order also names two directors who were not charged in Causa 89/2026."), 1600000000000, "PYG")
E("2026-11-03", "criminal", "EFE: embargo figures and 47 properties identified", "EFE: cifras del embargo y 47 propiedades identificadas", "EFE gives the embargo as about USD 70 million plus G. 1.6 trillion (about USD 255.6 million) and G. 58,639,000 in costs, and reports 47 properties linked to Ueno bank identified by the national registry.", "EFE cifra el embargo en unos USD 70 millones más G. 1,6 billones (unos USD 255,6 millones) y G. 58.639.000 de gastos, e informa de 47 propiedades vinculadas a Ueno bank identificadas por el registro nacional.", [BCP, GV, UB], P("press", "src:efe-2026-11-08-incautaciones", "civil embargo", "", "high", "Published 8 Nov; embargo dated 3 Nov per Última Hora."), 70000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-03", "market", "Securities regulator suspends trading in all ueno bank securities", "La Superintendencia de Valores suspende la negociación de todos los valores de ueno bank", "By Resolution SV.SG. N.º 0014/2026 (BVA Circular 13/2026) the Superintendency of Securities suspends the public offering and trading of all securities issued by ueno bank, including bonds originally issued by Visión Banco.", "Por Resolución SV.SG. N.º 0014/2026 (Circular 13/2026 de la BVA) la Superintendencia de Valores suspende la oferta pública y la negociación de todos los valores emitidos por ueno bank, incluidos bonos emitidos originalmente por Visión Banco.", [SIV, "org:bva", UB, "org:vision-banco"], P("regulator", "src:lanacion-2026-11-03-suspenden-bonos", "body", "", "high", "Article published 3 Nov 21:00; separate date of the resolution not stated."))
E("2026-11-03", "market", "FIX SCR cuts Grupo Vázquez from A+py to Cpy", "FIX SCR rebaja a Grupo Vázquez de A+py a Cpy", "In a report dated 3 November FIX cuts Grupo Vázquez S.A.E. to Cpy and seven bond programmes to pyC, citing the resolution of ueno bank (rated Dpy) and credit operations with related companies not disclosed in time; group debt excluding the bank is USD 341 million, with interest payments due from 19 November 2026.", "En un informe del 3 de noviembre FIX rebaja a Grupo Vázquez S.A.E. a Cpy y siete programas de bonos a pyC, por la resolución de ueno bank (calificado Dpy) y operaciones crediticias con vinculadas no reveladas a tiempo; la deuda del grupo sin el banco es de USD 341 millones, con vencimientos de intereses desde el 19 de noviembre de 2026.", ["org:fix-scr", GV, UB], P("rating_agency", "src:lanacion-2026-11-06-fix-grupo-vazquez", "body", "", "high", "Reported 6 Nov; report dated 3 Nov. No missed payment is declared in the report."), 341000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-03", "market", "FIX SCR cuts ITTI from A+py to Cpy", "FIX SCR rebaja a ITTI de A+py a Cpy", "FIX cuts ITTI S.A.E. to Cpy and five bond programmes to pyC; 59% of ITTI's revenue came from services to ueno bank; total debt USD 66 million.", "FIX rebaja a ITTI S.A.E. a Cpy y cinco programas de bonos a pyC; el 59 % de los ingresos de ITTI provenía de servicios a ueno bank; deuda total de USD 66 millones.", ["org:fix-scr", "org:itti", UB], P("rating_agency", "src:lanacion-2026-11-06-fix-itti", "body", "", "high", "Reported 6 Nov; report dated 3 Nov."), 66000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-03", "statement", "OTP: only a financial investor with no control or management rights", "OTP: solo inversor financiero, sin derechos de control ni de gestión", "OTP says it appeared only as a financial investor with under 10%, without control or management rights, and that the USD 47 million exposure is a fraction of a percent of its equity.", "OTP dice que participó solo como inversor financiero con menos del 10 %, sin derechos de control ni de gestión, y que la exposición de USD 47 millones es una fracción de punto porcentual de su patrimonio.", ["org:otp-bank", "org:u-holdings"], P("company", "src:telex-2026-11-03-otp", "OTP statement", "csak pénzügyi befektetőként jelentek meg"), 47000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-03", "statement", "Cadiem's first message to investors", "Primer mensaje de Cadiem a sus inversionistas", "Cadiem says it is following the BCP's provisions, evaluating effects and handling a high volume of queries; no exposure figures are given.", "Cadiem dice que sigue las disposiciones del BCP, evalúa los efectos y atiende un alto volumen de consultas; no da cifras de exposición.", ["org:cadiem"], P("company", "src:abc-2026-11-03-cadiem", "body", "nos mantenemos atentos a las disposiciones del Banco Central del Paraguay"))
E("2026-11-03", "depositor", "IPS exposure reported at about USD 345 million; MEF G. 250,000 million", "Exposición del IPS informada en unos USD 345 millones; MEF G. 250.000 millones", "Revista Foco reports IPS certificates of deposit of about G. 1.74 trillion, about 9% of its portfolio and roughly USD 345 million including bonds, and MEF exposure of G. 250,000 million.", "Revista Foco informa CDA del IPS por unos G. 1,74 billones, cerca del 9 % de su cartera y unos USD 345 millones incluyendo bonos, y una exposición del MEF de G. 250.000 millones.", ["org:ips", "auth:mef", UB], P("press", "src:revistafoco-2026-11-03-alcance", "exposure", "", "medium", "Conflict on IPS exposure: about USD 380 million (AP, 3 Nov), USD 355 million (Infobae), USD 516-517 million (AFP 11 Nov; 5Días 13 Nov), USD 500 million (Extra 20 Nov)."), 345000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-03", "depositor", "AP: state pension fund exposure about USD 380 million; 32,000 retirees to be moved", "AP: exposición del fondo previsional estatal de unos USD 380 millones; 32.000 jubilados serán migrados", "AP reports about USD 380 million invested by the state pension and health fund, which says payments to about 32,000 retirees paid through Ueno will continue via another bank and that it plans legal action.", "AP informa de unos USD 380 millones invertidos por el fondo estatal de pensiones y salud, que asegura que los pagos a unos 32.000 jubilados que cobraban por Ueno seguirán por otro banco y que prevé acciones legales.", ["org:ips", UB], P("press", AP, "public funds and pensions", "", "medium", "Conflict on IPS exposure; see the Revista Foco row of the same date."), 380000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-03", "political", "Senate approves in general the bill to advance up to 40 minimum wages", "El Senado aprueba en general el proyecto de anticipo de hasta 40 salarios mínimos", "In an extraordinary session the Senate approves in general, 35 to 1, a bill amending Law 2334/03 to allow an advance of up to about G. 121 million per depositor; it goes to the Chamber of Deputies. A senator proposes a bicameral investigative commission.", "En sesión extraordinaria el Senado aprueba en general, por 35 a 1, un proyecto que modifica la Ley 2334/03 para permitir un anticipo de hasta unos G. 121 millones por depositante; pasa a Diputados. Una senadora propone una comisión bicameral de investigación.", [SEN, FGD], P("press", "src:rdn-2026-11-04-senado", "body", "", "medium", "Second-hand (RDN citing ABC); vote dated 3 Nov from an embedded update. Senators' accusations in the debate are their own positions."), 121000000, "PYG")
E("2026-11-03", "criminal", "Night raid on Miguel Vázquez's residence; ABC reports a tender document for ITTI", "Allanamiento nocturno en la residencia de Miguel Vázquez; ABC informa de un documento sobre licitaciones para ITTI", "ABC reports that prosecutors Arce, Adle and Corbeta raided the residence on the night of 3 November and found a confidential document it describes as a plan for Itti to win tenders worth about USD 241 million through the Itaipú technology park.", "ABC informa que los fiscales Arce, Adle y Corbeta allanaron la residencia la noche del 3 de noviembre y hallaron un documento confidencial que describe como un plan para que Itti obtenga licitaciones por unos USD 241 millones a través del Parque Tecnológico Itaipú.", [MV, "org:itti", MP, "person:jorge-arce", "person:yeimy-adle", "person:silvio-corbeta"], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-04-libreto", "body", "", "low", "Single outlet's characterisation of a seized document; no statement from Vázquez, Itti or the defence is included. " + NOALLEG), 241000000, "USD")

# 4 November
E("2026-11-04", "criminal", "27 people charged in Causa 89/2026", "Imputación de 27 personas en la Causa 89/2026", "Prosecutors Arce, Corbeta, Adle and Cabrera charge 27 people in Expediente 89/2026 'Federico Miguel Vázquez Villasanti y otros s/ Lesión de Confianza y otros' with improper conduct in crisis situations, breach of trust, attempted fraud and breach of the duty to keep commercial books, over operations authorised in 2025-2026.", "Los fiscales Arce, Corbeta, Adle y Cabrera imputan a 27 personas en el Expediente 89/2026 'Federico Miguel Vázquez Villasanti y otros s/ Lesión de Confianza y otros' por conducta indebida en situaciones de crisis, lesión de confianza, tentativa de estafa y violación del deber de llevar libros de comercio, por operaciones autorizadas en 2025-2026.", EIGHT + [MP, UB], P("prosecution", LN4, "body", "habrían autorizado y permitido operaciones financieras entre 2025 y 2026", "high", NOALLEG + " Conflict on filing date: a court order quoted by ABC (5 Nov) says the charges were filed electronically on 3 Nov at 14:08."))
E("2026-11-04", "criminal", "Última Hora's list of the charged names only 25 of the 27", "La lista de Última Hora nombra solo a 25 de los 27", "Última Hora reports 27 charged and 'another 19' company-linked people but its text lists 17 of them, omitting César Astigarraga and Luis Ernesto Angulo Rivera; spokesman Aníbal Emery is cited.", "Última Hora informa de 27 imputados y 'otras 19' personas de empresas, pero su texto lista a 17, omitiendo a César Astigarraga y Luis Ernesto Angulo Rivera; cita al vocero Aníbal Emery.", [MP], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-04-fiscalia-imputa", "list", "", "high", "Conflict: La Nación (4 and 13 Nov) lists all 19. The article also spells the company both 'Frandede' and 'Franede'."))
E("2026-11-04", "criminal", "Measures requested: prison for Vázquez, house arrest for seven, travel ban and surety for 19; six months to investigate", "Medidas solicitadas: prisión para Vázquez, arresto domiciliario para siete, prohibición de salida y caución para 19; seis meses de investigación", "Per Independiente the Fiscalía asks for pre-trial detention of Vázquez; house arrest with ankle monitors, travel ban and surety for the other seven bank defendants; travel ban and surety for the 19; a general inhibition on selling or encumbering assets; and six months for the preparatory stage.", "Según Independiente la Fiscalía pide prisión preventiva para Vázquez; arresto domiciliario con tobillera, prohibición de salida y caución para los otros siete del banco; prohibición de salida y caución para los 19; inhibición general de vender y gravar bienes; y seis meses para la etapa preparatoria.", EIGHT + [MP], P("prosecution", INDEP, "measures", "", "high", "Conflict: La Nación (4 Nov) names six, not seven, for alternative measures (Mongelós is absent from that paragraph); Última Hora names seven. No article read gives the resulting deadline date for the final prosecutorial filing."))
E("2026-11-04", "criminal", "Duty judge Otazú admits the charges; measures hearing set for 5 November 07:30", "El juez de turno Otazú admite la imputación; audiencia de medidas el 5 de noviembre a las 07:30", "Duty guarantees judge Humberto Otazú admits the charges and summons the eight bank defendants to a measures hearing on Thursday at 07:30 before case judge Rodrigo Estigarribia; the remaining defendants are to be summoned later, with no date given.", "El juez de garantías de turno Humberto Otazú admite la imputación y convoca a los ocho del banco a audiencia de imposición de medidas el jueves a las 07:30 ante el juez de la causa, Rodrigo Estigarribia; los demás imputados serán citados luego, sin fecha.", EIGHT + [OTAZU, JUDGE], P("press", "src:lanacion-2026-11-04-juez-admite", "body"))
E("2026-11-04", "depositor", "Law 7745 promulgated: advance of up to 40 minimum wages", "Promulgación de la Ley 7745: anticipo de hasta 40 salarios mínimos", "Peña promulgates Law 7745, allowing an FGD advance of up to 40 minimum wages (G. 121,760,000) per depositor, starting within 24 hours and taking up to five business days.", "Peña promulga la Ley 7745, que permite un anticipo del FGD de hasta 40 salarios mínimos (G. 121.760.000) por depositante, a iniciarse en 24 horas y con un máximo de cinco días hábiles.", [PENA, FGD, BCP], P("press", D5, "4 Nov entry", "", "high", "EFE (15 Nov) also dates promulgation to 4 Nov and cites 'Ley N° 7745/2026'."), 121760000, "PYG")
E("2026-11-04", "political", "Impeachment accusation against Peña and Alliana filed with 35 signatures", "Presentan libelo acusatorio contra Peña y Alliana con 35 firmas", "Opposition and dissident deputies file an impeachment motion under Article 225 of the Constitution with 35 signatures; 53 of 80 deputies are needed to accuse and 30 of 45 senators to convict.", "Diputados opositores y disidentes presentan un pedido de juicio político con base en el artículo 225 de la Constitución, con 35 firmas; se requieren 53 de 80 diputados para acusar y 30 de 45 senadores para condenar.", [PENA, "person:pedro-alliana", "auth:camara-de-diputados", SEN], P("press", "src:infobae-2026-11-05-cartes", "impeachment filing"))
E("2026-11-04", "political", "Peña nominates Raúl Vera Bogado to head the BCP", "Peña propone a Raúl Vera Bogado para presidir el BCP", "Peña names economist and former minister Raúl Vera Bogado to replace Carvallo, subject to Senate approval.", "Peña propone al economista y exministro Raúl Vera Bogado para reemplazar a Carvallo, sujeto al acuerdo del Senado.", [PENA, "person:raul-vera-bogado", BCP, SEN], P("press", "src:infobae-2026-11-05-cartes", "BCP nomination", "", "medium", "Exact date not stated (reported on the morning of 5 Nov); the Senate later approved Jorge Schreiner instead (9 Nov, per 5Días)."))
E("2026-11-04", "supervisory", "Marco Aurelio González resigns from the BCP board; Pedro Acosta becomes interim president", "Marco Aurelio González renuncia al directorio del BCP; Pedro Acosta asume como presidente interino", "5Días reports that González's resignation left the board without quorum and that Pedro Acosta Bernal joined and became interim president.", "5Días informa que la renuncia de González dejó al directorio sin quórum y que Pedro Acosta Bernal se incorporó y asumió la presidencia interina.", ["person:marco-aurelio-gonzalez", "person:pedro-acosta", BCP], P("press", D5, "4 Nov entry", "", "medium", "Conflict: La Política Online and ABC describe Liana Caballero (ABC also Mora) as interim BCP president after Carvallo's resignation."))
E("2026-11-04", "market", "Fitch cuts ueno bank to 'D'", "Fitch rebaja a ueno bank a 'D'", "Fitch cuts the long-term issuer default ratings from BB to D and the short-term ratings from B to D, and withdraws government support, saying the issuer entered liquidation and ceased operations.", "Fitch rebaja las calificaciones de emisor de largo plazo de BB a D y las de corto plazo de B a D, y retira el apoyo gubernamental, al señalar que el emisor entró en liquidación y cesó operaciones.", ["org:fitch", UB], P("rating_agency", "src:mercadoeconsumo-2026-11-05-fitch-default", "Fitch paragraph", "", "medium", "Second-hand (Estadão Conteúdo, published 5 Nov); date inferred from 'ontem'. Primary Fitch release not opened."))
E("2026-11-04", "market", "Moody's note: the Ueno resolution is manageable but will test the bank-failure framework", "Nota de Moody's: la resolución de Ueno es manejable pero pondrá a prueba el marco de quiebras bancarias", "Perfil cites a Moody's report of 4 November titled to the effect that the Ueno resolution is manageable but will test Paraguay's bank-failure management framework.", "Perfil cita un informe de Moody's del 4 de noviembre titulado en el sentido de que la resolución de Ueno es manejable pero pondrá a prueba el marco de gestión de quiebras bancarias de Paraguay.", ["org:moodys", UB], P("rating_agency", "src:perfil-2026-11-05-riesgo-pais", "Moody's", "", "medium", "Second-hand via Perfil."))

# 5 November
E("2026-11-05", "criminal", "A.I. N.º 359: pre-trial detention for six bank defendants, house arrest for two", "A.I. N.º 359: prisión preventiva para seis directivos y arresto domiciliario para dos", "Judge Rodrigo Estigarribia orders pre-trial detention of Vázquez, Gustale, Rey and Gómez Abente (Centro Nacional de Prevenidos) and of Duarte Schussmuller and Almada Frutos (Emboscada), and house arrest with ankle monitor for Mongelós and Torres Rubiani, finding the sureties insufficient as offered and the economic scale of the operations relevant to flight risk. Duarte's defence gets 15 days to file appraisals.", "El juez Rodrigo Estigarribia dicta prisión preventiva para Vázquez, Gustale, Rey y Gómez Abente (Centro Nacional de Prevenidos) y para Duarte Schussmuller y Almada Frutos (Emboscada), y arresto domiciliario con tobillera para Mongelós y Torres Rubiani, al considerar insuficientes las cauciones ofrecidas y relevante la magnitud económica para el peligro de fuga. La defensa de Duarte recibe 15 días para presentar tasaciones.", EIGHT + [JUDGE], P("press", ABC5, "ruling", "las cauciones ofrecidas no pueden considerarse actualmente suficientes", "high", "The judge went beyond the prosecution's request (prison only for Vázquez). Conflict on place of detention for Duarte: Emboscada (this article) vs Centro Nacional de Prevenidos (ABC 16 Nov)."))
E("2026-11-05", "criminal", "Última Hora: six to the police Judiciales department pending assignment of a prison", "Última Hora: los seis van a Judiciales a la espera de destino penitenciario", "Última Hora reports the same measures, says the six were sent first to the police Judiciales department pending a decision of the Ministry of Justice, and that the other 19 would be notified and summoned to a measures hearing with no date given.", "Última Hora informa las mismas medidas, dice que los seis fueron derivados primero al Departamento de Judiciales a la espera de la decisión del Ministerio de Justicia, y que los otros 19 serían notificados y citados a audiencia de medidas, sin fecha.", EIGHT + [JUDGE], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-05-prision-seis", "body", "", "high", "A later Última Hora headline (6 Nov) says Vázquez and five others would be held at ex-Tacumbú."))
E("2026-11-05", "statement", "Defences at the measures hearing: acceptance of alternatives and offers of surety", "Defensas en la audiencia de medidas: allanamiento a las alternativas y ofrecimiento de cauciones", "The lawyer of Gustale, Gómez Abente and Duarte accepted the alternative measures requested by the prosecution and offered real-estate sureties; Vázquez's lawyers invoked his roots in the country and asked for house arrest with ankle monitor; Rey's and Almada's lawyers offered personal and real sureties.", "El abogado de Gustale, Gómez Abente y Duarte se allanó a las medidas alternativas pedidas por la Fiscalía y ofreció cauciones reales; los abogados de Vázquez invocaron su arraigo y pidieron arresto domiciliario con tobillera; los abogados de Rey y de Almada ofrecieron cauciones personales y reales.", [MV, GUST, REY, "person:alejandro-gomez-abente", "person:diego-duarte", "person:miguel-angel-almada", "person:jose-miguel-fernandez-zacur", "person:guillermo-ferreiro"], P("defence", ABC5, "defence submissions", "un arraigo efectivo en el país", "high", "Names of sureties and family details in the article are not recorded."))
E("2026-11-03", "statement", "Rey's defence files a habeas corpus alleging the 24-hour deadline was exceeded", "La defensa de Rey plantea un habeas corpus por exceso del plazo de 24 horas", "Lawyer Guillermo Ferreiro files a habeas corpus for Julio Rey, arguing that the Fiscalía exceeded the 24-hour deadline to bring him before a judge and that he is unlawfully deprived of liberty.", "El abogado Guillermo Ferreiro plantea un habeas corpus reparador a favor de Julio Rey, alegando que la Fiscalía excedió el plazo de 24 horas para ponerlo a disposición de un juez y que está ilegítimamente privado de su libertad.", [REY, "person:guillermo-ferreiro"], P("defence", "src:abc-2026-11-05-habeas-corpus", "body", "se encuentra ilegítimamente privado de su libertad", "medium", "Filing time given in the court order as 18:00 on 3 Nov; article published 5 Nov."))
E("2026-11-05", "criminal", "Habeas corpus for Rey rejected (A.I. N.º 1736)", "Rechazo del habeas corpus de Rey (A.I. N.º 1736)", "Judge Clara Ruiz Díaz (Guarantees Court N.º 1) rejects the habeas corpus, finding that the deprivation of liberty has a judicial basis; the order says the charges were filed electronically on 3 November at 14:08 and on paper at 16:20.", "La jueza Clara Ruiz Díaz (Juzgado Penal de Garantías N.º 1) rechaza el habeas corpus, al concluir que la privación de libertad cuenta con fundamento jurisdiccional; el auto dice que la imputación se presentó electrónicamente el 3 de noviembre a las 14:08 y en papel a las 16:20.", [REY, "person:clara-ruiz-diaz"], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-05-habeas-corpus", "outcome", "cuenta actualmente con un fundamento jurisdiccional", "medium", "Date of the order not stated (reported 5 Nov). Conflict: La Nación, Última Hora and Independiente date the charges to 4 Nov."))
E("2026-11-05", "criminal", "General inhibition and bank-account freeze decreed against the charged and linked companies", "Inhibición general y bloqueo de cuentas contra imputados y empresas vinculadas", "Judge Estigarribia decrees a general inhibition on selling and encumbering assets and the preventive freezing of bank accounts of the charged persons and of Mowi, Grupo Hendy, Grupo M, Tuiu, Franede, Aime and Vinanzas, at the prosecutors' request; he states the measures do not imply criminal liability.", "El juez Estigarribia decreta la inhibición general de vender y gravar bienes y la inmovilización preventiva de cuentas bancarias de los imputados y de Mowi, Grupo Hendy, Grupo M, Tuiu, Franede, Aime y Vinanzas, a pedido de los fiscales; aclara que las medidas no implican responsabilidad penal.", [JUDGE, "org:mowi", "org:grupo-hendy", "org:grupo-m", "org:tuiu", "org:franede", "org:aime", "org:vinanzas"] + EIGHT, P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-05-inhibicion", "body", "", "medium", "The article's own counts do not match (27 charged; 28 names listed; 34 natural and legal persons in the operative part). Conflict: ABC and Última Hora (17 Nov) cite A.I. N.º 362 of 6 Nov against ten legal persons."))
E("2026-11-05", "criminal", "Fiscalía asks Seprelad for financial reports on the 27 and 20 linked companies", "La Fiscalía pide a Seprelad informes financieros sobre los 27 y 20 empresas vinculadas", "Prosecutor Yeimy Adle asks the anti-money-laundering secretariat for financial and corporate background on the 27 charged and on 20 linked companies, within five business days.", "La fiscal Yeimy Adle pide a la Seprelad antecedentes financieros y societarios de los 27 imputados y de 20 empresas vinculadas, en cinco días hábiles.", [MP, "person:yeimy-adle", "auth:seprelad"], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-05-seprelad", "body"))
E("2026-11-05", "depositor", "FGD advances begin", "Comienzan los anticipos del FGD", "Advances of up to G. 121.76 million per depositor from the Deposit Guarantee Fund begin on 5 November.", "El 5 de noviembre comienzan los anticipos de hasta G. 121,76 millones por depositante del Fondo de Garantía de Depósitos.", [FGD, BCP], P("press", "src:gfmag-2026-11-12-fgd", "timeline", "", "high", "Infobae/AP: holders of up to G. 10 million began recovering funds from Thursday night."), 121760000, "PYG")
E("2026-11-05", "market", "BVA suspends Ueno Casa de Bolsa and Valores Casa de Bolsa", "La BVA suspende a Ueno Casa de Bolsa y a Valores Casa de Bolsa", "The stock exchange preventively suspends Ueno Casa de Bolsa S.A. (failed repo settlement on 3 Nov; note BVA N.º 222/26) and Valores Casa de Bolsa S.A. (failed settlements on 29 Oct, 2 Nov and 4 Nov; note BVA N.º 224/26).", "La bolsa suspende preventivamente a Ueno Casa de Bolsa S.A. (incumplimiento de recompra de reporto el 3/11; nota BVA N.º 222/26) y a Valores Casa de Bolsa S.A. (incumplimientos el 29/10, 2/11 y 4/11; nota BVA N.º 224/26).", ["org:bva", "org:ueno-casa-de-bolsa", "org:valores-casa-de-bolsa", SIV], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-06-bva-suspende", "body", "no serán liquidados hasta nuevo aviso", "high", "Amounts not stated."))
E("2026-11-05", "market", "Five Cadiem mutual funds suspended; Ueno instruments valued at zero", "Suspensión de cinco fondos mutuos de Cadiem; instrumentos de Ueno valuados en cero", "Under Resolution SV.SG. N.º 0015/2026 redemptions and subscriptions are suspended in five Cadiem funds holding instruments of ueno bank and of two group companies; the regulator sets extraordinary criteria valuing ueno bank instruments at zero during the resolution.", "Por la Resolución SV.SG. N.º 0015/2026 se suspenden rescates y suscripciones en cinco fondos de Cadiem con instrumentos de ueno bank y de dos empresas del grupo; el regulador fija criterios extraordinarios que valúan en cero los instrumentos de ueno bank durante la resolución.", [SIV, "org:cadiem", UB], P("regulator", "src:revistaplus-2026-11-05-cadiem-fondos", "body", "no constituyen depósitos en ueno bank", "medium", "Date of the resolution not stated; reported 5 Nov. The two group companies are not named."))
E("2026-11-05", "political", "Cartes says the Colorado Party will back the impeachment", "Cartes anuncia que el Partido Colorado acompañará el juicio político", "ANR president Horacio Cartes announces on X, as quoted by Infobae, that the party backs the impeachment of Santiago Peña.", "El titular de la ANR, Horacio Cartes, anuncia en X, según cita Infobae, que el partido acompaña el juicio político a Santiago Peña.", ["person:horacio-cartes", "org:anr", PENA], P("press", "src:infobae-2026-11-05-cartes", "Cartes", "Acompañamos el juicio político al presidente de la República, Santiago Peña", "high", "Social-media post as quoted by the outlet."))
E("2026-11-05", "political", "Peña presents his resignation; Congress does not accept it", "Peña presenta su renuncia; el Congreso no la acepta", "Peña presents his resignation; Congress does not accept it and the impeachment continues.", "Peña presenta su renuncia; el Congreso no la acepta y el juicio político continúa.", [PENA, SEN, "auth:camara-de-diputados"], P("press", D5, "5 Nov entries", "", "high", "Infobae (6 Nov): Colorado legislators left the session, leaving it without quorum."))
E("2026-11-05", "political", "Chamber of Deputies approves the impeachment accusation unanimously", "Diputados aprueba por unanimidad la acusación del juicio político", "5Días reports that the Chamber of Deputies unanimously approved the impeachment.", "5Días informa que la Cámara de Diputados aprobó por unanimidad el juicio político.", ["auth:camara-de-diputados", PENA], P("press", D5, "5 Nov entries", "", "medium", "Vote count not given in the pages opened."))
E("2026-11-05", "criminal", "Opposition widens its complaint to Carvallo, Insfrán and other officials", "La oposición amplía su denuncia a Carvallo, Insfrán y otros funcionarios", "Six senators and four deputies widen the 2025 complaint against Peña, formally denouncing Carvallo and Insfrán for alleged breach of trust and asking to investigate the rest of the BCP board and authorities of entities that deposited public funds at ueno.", "Seis senadores y cuatro diputados amplían la denuncia de 2025 contra Peña, denunciando formalmente a Carvallo e Insfrán por presunta lesión de confianza y pidiendo investigar al resto del directorio del BCP y a autoridades de entes que depositaron fondos públicos en ueno.", [PENA, CARV, INSF, MP, "person:rafael-filizzola", "person:yolanda-paredes"], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-05-oposicion-denuncia", "body", "", "high", "Complaint by legislators; allegations only."))
E("2026-11-05", "criminal", "Fiscalía opens further criminal cases over public deposits", "La Fiscalía abre nuevas causas por los depósitos públicos", "5Días reports a criminal case opened under Resolución FGE N.º 4474 and a MEF complaint over G. 250,000 million of pension funds; Infobae/AP reports three criminal cases opened over public deposits at Ueno.", "5Días informa de una causa abierta por Resolución FGE N.º 4474 y de una denuncia del MEF por G. 250.000 millones de fondos jubilatorios; Infobae/AP informa de tres causas penales abiertas por los depósitos públicos en Ueno.", [MP, "auth:mef"], P("press", D5, "5 Nov entries"), 250000000000, "PYG")
E("2026-11-05", "criminal", "Raids on ITTI and Grupo Vázquez offices", "Allanamientos en oficinas de ITTI y Grupo Vázquez", "From about 21:00 prosecutors raid the offices of ITTI S.A.E.C.A. and Grupo Vázquez in Asunción, seizing computers, phones, files and storage devices.", "Desde las 21:00 aproximadamente los fiscales allanan las oficinas de ITTI S.A.E.C.A. y Grupo Vázquez en Asunción e incautan computadoras, teléfonos, carpetas y dispositivos de almacenamiento.", ["org:itti", GV, MP, "person:francisco-cabrera", "person:marlene-gonzalez", "person:yeimy-adle", "person:ruth-benitez"], P("press", "src:rdn-2026-11-06-itti", "body", "", "medium", "Second-hand (RDN citing ABC); time from 5Días. RDN describes ITTI as a technology firm with a close operating relationship with the bank."))
E("2026-11-05", "criminal", "Yacht seized in Itapúa; aircraft seized the next day", "Incautación de un yate en Itapúa; al día siguiente, de una aeronave", "Prosecutor Ruth Benítez leads the seizure of an Azimut yacht on Thursday night at San Juan del Paraná and, on Friday, of a Beechcraft King Air 300 at Silvio Pettirossi airport, both attributed to Miguel Vázquez.", "La fiscal Ruth Benítez encabeza la incautación de un yate Azimut la noche del jueves en San Juan del Paraná y, el viernes, de un Beechcraft King Air 300 en el aeropuerto Silvio Pettirossi, ambos atribuidos a Miguel Vázquez.", [MV, MP, "person:ruth-benitez"], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-06-yate-avioneta", "body", "", "high", "EFE (8 Nov) lists two aircraft (a Beech 300 registered to Ueno and a Beechcraft B55 of Grupo Vázquez) and nine vehicles handed to Senabico."))
E("2026-11-05", "market", "Country risk at 144 bp; wholesale dollar at G. 6,358.5", "Riesgo país en 144 pb; dólar mayorista a G. 6.358,5", "Perfil reports JP Morgan's country-risk index at 144 basis points (119 a week earlier; 157 intraday), the wholesale dollar at G. 6,358.5 (up about 5.4% on the day) and the 2036 bond yield at 6.04%.", "Perfil informa el índice de riesgo país de JP Morgan en 144 puntos básicos (119 una semana antes; 157 intradiario), el dólar mayorista a G. 6.358,5 (alza diaria de 5,4 %) y el rendimiento del bono 2036 en 6,04 %.", [], P("press", "src:perfil-2026-11-05-riesgo-pais", "market figures", "", "medium", "Market quotes from a foreign outlet, partly citing ABC Color."))
E("2026-11-05", "corporate", "Kaitel suspends workers in Argentina without pay", "Kaitel suspende sin goce de sueldo a trabajadores en Argentina", "Kaitel SRL Sucursal Argentina, part of ITTI, with more than 900 workers, suspends staff without pay from 5 November to 4 December 2026.", "Kaitel SRL Sucursal Argentina, parte de ITTI, con más de 900 trabajadores, suspende personal sin goce de sueldo del 5 de noviembre al 4 de diciembre de 2026.", ["org:kaitel", "org:itti"], P("press", "src:infobae-2026-11-06-claves", "Argentina impact", "", "medium", "The company did not say how many workers were suspended."))
E("2026-11-05", "statement", "Banks' association: the rest of the system is operating normally", "Asoban: el resto del sistema opera con normalidad", "The Paraguayan banks' association, representing 14 private banks, says the rest of the financial system is operating normally.", "La Asociación de Bancos del Paraguay, que agrupa a 14 bancos privados, dice que el resto del sistema financiero opera con normalidad.", [], P("press", "src:infobae-2026-11-06-claves", "depositor repayment law", "", "medium"))
E("2026-11-05", "criminal", "ABC: detention order against Astigarraga in force since 5 November", "ABC: orden de detención contra Astigarraga vigente desde el 5 de noviembre", "ABC states that César Astigarraga was a fugitive from Thursday 5 November 2026.", "ABC afirma que César Astigarraga estuvo prófugo desde el jueves 5 de noviembre de 2026.", ["person:cesar-astigarraga", MP], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-19-astigarraga-recurso", "fugitive and surrender", "", "medium", "Conflict: Última Hora (11 Nov) reports that prosecutor Silvio Corbeta requested his detention on Tuesday 10 Nov, until which he was a charged person at liberty."))

# 6 November
E("2026-11-06", "political", "Senate rejects a 72-hour extension for the defence, 39 to 3", "El Senado rechaza la prórroga de 72 horas para la defensa por 39 a 3", "At 11:42 the Senate rejects Peña's request for 72 more hours (39 against, 3 in favour, 2 abstentions); at 14:35 it admits the accusers' evidence 41 to 0.", "A las 11:42 el Senado rechaza el pedido de Peña de 72 horas adicionales (39 en contra, 3 a favor, 2 abstenciones); a las 14:35 admite las pruebas de la acusación por 41 a 0.", [SEN, PENA], P("press", LIVE, "11:42 and 14:35 entries"))
E("2026-11-06", "political", "Impeachment accusers' case: alleged steering of public funds and capture of the regulator", "Tesis de la acusación en el juicio político: presunto direccionamiento de fondos públicos y captura del regulador", "Deputies acting as accusers argue that Peña led actions exposing savers and pensioners to losses they put at USD 1.2 billion, that he knew the bank would fall, and that he damaged the Central Bank's reputation.", "Los diputados acusadores sostienen que Peña lideró actuaciones que expusieron a ahorristas y pensionistas a pérdidas que cifran en USD 1.200 millones, que sabía que el banco iba a caer y que dañó la reputación del Banco Central.", [PENA, "person:rocio-vallejo", "auth:camara-de-diputados", SEN], P("press", "src:infobae-2026-11-06-destitucion", "prosecution claims", "Peña sabía que el banco iba a caer", "high", "Political accusation by deputies, not a judicial finding; the matching defence position is the next row."), 1200000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-06", "statement", "Defence in the Senate: the accusation rests on indicia and identifies no act by Peña", "Defensa en el Senado: el libelo se basa en indicios y no identifica ningún acto de Peña", "Ricardo Preda argues that the accusation proves no direct intervention by Peña, that he had sold his stake, that the scheme under investigation was built 2 to 14 months later while hiding information from the Central Bank, that the BCP itself detected the irregularities and filed the complaint, and that the Senate, with 45 votes, approved Carvallo.", "Ricardo Preda sostiene que el libelo no prueba una intervención directa de Peña, que había vendido su participación, que el esquema investigado se armó entre 2 y 14 meses después ocultando información al Banco Central, que el propio BCP detectó las irregularidades y denunció, y que el Senado aprobó a Carvallo con 45 votos.", [PENA, "person:ricardo-preda", SEN, BCP, CARV], P("defence", PREDA, "arguments 1-17", "Con indicios no se remueve a nadie"))
E("2026-11-06", "statement", "Defence in the Senate: insufficient time and trial moot after the resignation", "Defensa en el Senado: tiempo insuficiente y juicio sin objeto tras la renuncia", "Adolfo Ferreiro and Ricardo Preda say they had about 12 hours for a 300-page accusation, that the evidence is mostly press clippings, that the trial has no object after the resignation, and that Peña could go to the Inter-American system.", "Adolfo Ferreiro y Ricardo Preda dicen que tuvieron unas 12 horas para un libelo de 300 páginas, que las pruebas son mayormente recortes de prensa, que el juicio carece de objeto tras la renuncia y que Peña podría acudir al sistema interamericano.", [PENA, "person:adolfo-ferreiro", "person:ricardo-preda", SEN], P("defence", LIVE, "13:18-14:31 and 17:37-17:50 entries", "estrepitoso fracaso"))
E("2026-11-06", "political", "Senate removes Peña for poor performance of duties with 44 votes", "El Senado destituye a Peña por mal desempeño con 44 votos", "At 18:55 the Senate removes Santiago Peña for mal desempeño de funciones with 44 votes and refers the file to the Fiscalía; Peña does not attend and posts a farewell message at 18:26.", "A las 18:55 el Senado destituye a Santiago Peña por mal desempeño de funciones con 44 votos y remite los antecedentes a la Fiscalía; Peña no asiste y publica un mensaje de despedida a las 18:26.", [SEN, PENA], P("press", LIVE, "18:26 and 18:55 entries", "Presenté mi renuncia para evitar más daño al país", "high", "The live blog gives 45 senators enabled at 18:45 but 44 present earlier. Post on X as quoted by the outlet."))
E("2026-11-06", "political", "Pedro Alliana sworn in as president; Antonio Barrios as vice-president", "Pedro Alliana jura como presidente; Antonio Barrios como vicepresidente", "Alliana is sworn in at about 19:45 for the rest of the 2023-2028 term and promises a public-spending rationalisation plan and attention to savers; Congress elects senator Antonio Barrios vice-president at 20:10.", "Alliana jura cerca de las 19:45 para completar el período 2023-2028 y promete un plan de racionalización del gasto y atención a los ahorristas; el Congreso elige vicepresidente al senador Antonio Barrios a las 20:10.", ["person:pedro-alliana", "person:antonio-barrios", SEN], P("press", LIVE, "19:45-20:18 entries"))
E("2026-11-06", "political", "Resignations in the Executive; US Embassy and OAS statements", "Renuncias en el Ejecutivo; pronunciamientos de la Embajada de EE. UU. y la OEA", "The chief of cabinet, the interior minister and the legal adviser resign in the morning; the US Embassy calls for peace and respect for institutions (12:05) and the OAS Secretary General calls for adherence to the Constitution (18:42).", "El jefe de gabinete, el ministro del Interior y el asesor jurídico renuncian por la mañana; la Embajada de EE. UU. llama a la paz y al respeto institucional (12:05) y el secretario general de la OEA pide apego a la Constitución (18:42).", [PENA], P("press", LIVE, "10:15, 12:05 and 18:42 entries", "", "high", "Conflict: 5Días dates the acceptance of the interior minister's resignation (Decreto N.º 7199) to 5 Nov."))
E("2026-11-06", "criminal", "Fiscalía orders the detention of Peña and Carvallo in Causa 92/2026", "La Fiscalía ordena la detención de Peña y Carvallo en la Causa 92/2026", "At 19:41 the prosecution requests the detention of Peña and former BCP president Carvallo in case N.º 92/2026 (Detention Resolution N.º 7); at 20:05 police place Peña under detention at his home.", "A las 19:41 la Fiscalía dispone la detención de Peña y del expresidente del BCP Carvallo en la causa N.º 92/2026 (Resolución de detención N.º 7); a las 20:05 la Policía detiene a Peña en su domicilio.", [PENA, CARV, MP], P("press", LIVE, "19:41 and 20:05 entries"))
E("2026-11-06", "criminal", "Carvallo presents himself to the authorities (6 November per Infobae)", "Carvallo se presenta ante las autoridades (6 de noviembre según Infobae)", "Infobae reports that Carvallo was detained on Friday after presenting himself to the authorities.", "Infobae informa que Carvallo fue detenido el viernes tras presentarse ante las autoridades.", [CARV], P("press", "src:infobae-2026-11-07-prision-pena", "Carvallo", "", "medium", "Conflict on date: La Política Online says he presented himself to the police on 7 Nov; ABC (16 Nov) says he has been held 'since Friday night'."))
E("2026-11-07", "criminal", "La Política Online: Carvallo presented himself on 7 November", "La Política Online: Carvallo se presentó el 7 de noviembre", "La Política Online dates Carvallo's presentation to the police, after an arrest order, to 7 November.", "La Política Online fecha el 7 de noviembre la presentación de Carvallo ante la Policía tras una orden de captura.", [CARV], P("press", "src:lpo-2026-11-13-excupula-bcp", "Carvallo", "", "low", "Conflict on date: Infobae and ABC indicate Friday 6 Nov."))
E("2026-11-06", "criminal", "A.I. N.º 362: general inhibition against ten legal persons", "A.I. N.º 362: inhibición general contra diez personas jurídicas", "ABC cites interlocutory order A.I. N.º 362 of 6 November 2026 ordering a general inhibition on selling and encumbering against ten legal persons, including Grupo Vázquez S.A.E.", "ABC cita el auto interlocutorio A.I. N.º 362 del 6 de noviembre de 2026, que ordenó la inhibición general de vender y gravar contra diez personas jurídicas, entre ellas Grupo Vázquez S.A.E.", [JUDGE, GV], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-17-clan-vazquez", "basis of the measures", "", "medium", "Conflict: Última Hora (5 Nov) reports an inhibition already decreed on 5 Nov covering seven companies."))
E("2026-11-06", "statement", "Vázquez's defence appeals detention and asks for house arrest", "La defensa de Vázquez apela la prisión y pide arresto domiciliario", "Lawyers Gulino and Cáceres Alsina appeal on 6 November, citing family and work ties, voluntary presentation and cooperation during the raid, that the bank's documents are under BCP control, and offering real-estate surety valued at G. 2,925 million.", "Los abogados Gulino y Cáceres Alsina apelan el 6 de noviembre invocando arraigo familiar y laboral, presentación voluntaria y colaboración en el allanamiento, que la documentación del banco está bajo control del BCP, y ofreciendo caución real valuada en G. 2.925 millones.", [MV, "person:victor-dante-gulino", "person:alvaro-caceres", TRIB], P("defence", "src:prensamercosur-2026-11-10-fiscalia-vazquez", "defence appeal", "", "medium", "Second-hand (Prensa Mercosur reproducing El Observador). Family details in the article are not recorded."), 2925000000, "PYG")
E("2026-11-06", "statement", "Video of Vázquez telling staff the money was 'ultra-shielded' is published", "Se difunde un video de Vázquez diciendo al personal que el dinero estaba 'ultrablindado'", "Última Hora publishes a video, recorded before the intervention and addressed to bank staff, in which Vázquez says nothing will happen to the bank and that an entity would enter a regularisation plan rather than be intervened.", "Última Hora difunde un video, grabado antes de la intervención y dirigido al personal, en el que Vázquez dice que al banco no le va a pasar nada y que una entidad entraría en un plan de regularización en lugar de ser intervenida.", [MV, UB], P("company", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-06-ultrablindado", "body", "al banco no le va a pasar nada, el dinero está ultrablindado", "medium", "Date and place of the recording are not given; the date is that of publication. Video circulated on social media as reported by the outlet."))
E("2026-11-06", "market", "Moody's: no immediate impact on the sovereign (Baa3 stable); episode underscores institutional weaknesses", "Moody's: sin impacto inmediato en el soberano (Baa3 estable); el episodio subraya debilidades institucionales", "Moody's says Ueno held 8% of system loans and 9% of deposits at September 2026, that about 97% of depositors would be fully covered and the FGD had liquidity of USD 1.6 billion, and that systemic risks could stay contained if the resolution is fast and orderly.", "Moody's indica que Ueno tenía el 8 % de los créditos y el 9 % de los depósitos del sistema a septiembre de 2026, que cerca del 97 % de los depositantes quedaría totalmente cubierto y que el FGD tenía liquidez por USD 1.600 millones, y que los riesgos sistémicos podrían mantenerse contenidos con una resolución rápida y ordenada.", ["org:moodys", UB, FGD], P("rating_agency", "src:expansion-2026-11-06-moodys", "key facts", "riesgos sistémicos podrían mantenerse contenidos"), 1600000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-06", "market", "Moody's on fiscal cost (Revista PLUS)", "Moody's sobre el costo fiscal (Revista PLUS)", "Revista PLUS, on the same 6 November report, notes that Moody's sees direct costs to the State as limited for now and that using the fund to return deposits is not automatically a fiscal expense; costs could arise if public entities book losses on unrecovered balances.", "Revista PLUS, sobre el mismo informe del 6 de noviembre, señala que Moody's ve limitados por ahora los costos directos para el Estado y que usar el fondo para devolver depósitos no es automáticamente un gasto fiscal; podrían surgir costos si los entes públicos registran pérdidas sobre saldos no recuperados.", ["org:moodys", FGD], P("rating_agency", "src:revistaplus-2026-11-07-moodys", "fiscal cost", "no representa automáticamente un gasto fiscal"))
E("2026-11-06", "market", "Suspension of Cadiem and Puente funds lifted; Ueno AFPISA funds stay suspended", "Levantan la suspensión de fondos de Cadiem y Puente; siguen suspendidos los de Ueno AFPISA", "The Superintendency of Securities lifts the suspension of the mutual funds of Cadiem AFPISA and Puente AFPISA (BASA and BNB funds had already resumed); the two funds of ueno AFPISA remain suspended for operational impediments.", "La Superintendencia de Valores levanta la suspensión de los fondos mutuos de Cadiem AFPISA y Puente AFPISA (los de BASA y BNB ya habían reanudado); los dos fondos de ueno AFPISA siguen suspendidos por impedimentos operativos.", [SIV, "org:cadiem", "org:puente-afpisa", "org:ueno-afpisa"], P("regulator", "src:revistaplus-2026-11-06-levanta-restricciones", "body", "", "high", "Exact date and resolution of the lifting not stated; reported 6 Nov (also Diario HOY, separate row)."))
E("2026-11-06", "market", "Diario HOY: regulator explains the status of mutual funds", "Diario HOY: el regulador explica la situación de los fondos mutuos", "HOY reports the regulator's explanation that each fund has its own assets separate from the administrator and the bank, that the suspension was not a closure, and that there is no date for resuming redemptions at Ueno AFPISA.", "HOY recoge la explicación del regulador de que cada fondo tiene patrimonio propio, separado de la administradora y del banco, que la suspensión no implica cierre y que no hay fecha para reanudar rescates en Ueno AFPISA.", [SIV, "org:ueno-afpisa", "org:cadiem"], P("regulator", "src:hoy-2026-11-06-fondos-mutuos", "body"))
E("2026-11-06", "market", "Cadiem reports redemption requests of about USD 160 million", "Cadiem informa pedidos de rescate por unos USD 160 millones", "Cadiem says redemption requests equal about USD 160 million, roughly 40% of the USD 400 million it manages, and that it is preparing a regularisation plan with the regulator.", "Cadiem dice que los pedidos de rescate equivalen a unos USD 160 millones, cerca del 40 % de los USD 400 millones que administra, y que prepara un plan de regularización con el regulador.", ["org:cadiem", SIV], P("company", "src:revistaplus-2026-11-06-cadiem-rescates", "body"), 160000000, "USD")

# 7-10 November
E("2026-11-07", "criminal", "Peña charged and placed in pre-trial detention at the Regimiento Escolta Presidencial", "Peña, imputado y con prisión preventiva en el Regimiento Escolta Presidencial", "Peña abstains from testifying; judge Humberto Otazú orders pre-trial detention on charges of breach of trust (as instigator) and administration for own benefit (as author). Prosecutors say he took part in placing, renewing and keeping large public and pension sums at the bank.", "Peña se abstiene de declarar; el juez Humberto Otazú dicta prisión preventiva por lesión de confianza (como instigador) y administración en provecho propio (como autor). La Fiscalía sostiene que participó en la colocación, renovación y permanencia de grandes sumas públicas y previsionales en el banco.", [PENA, OTAZU, MP], P("press", "src:efe-2026-11-07-prision-pena", "body", "maneja demasiada información sensible", "high", NOALLEG))
E("2026-11-07", "statement", "Peña's defence: venue adequate, no immediate appeal, expects dismissal", "Defensa de Peña: lugar adecuado, sin apelación inmediata, espera el sobreseimiento", "Preda calls the military venue adequate, says the defence will not appeal immediately and will submit to the investigation, that the president does not tell ministers where to deposit, that Peña held no direct shares in the bank, and questions that the charges came the day after the complaint; Peña declares himself innocent.", "Preda califica de adecuada la unidad militar, dice que no apelarán de inmediato y que se someterán a la investigación, que el presidente no indica a los ministros dónde depositar, que Peña no tenía acciones directas del banco, y cuestiona que la imputación llegara al día siguiente de la denuncia; Peña se declara inocente.", [PENA, "person:ricardo-preda"], P("defence", PREDA2, "defence statements", "Vamos a esperar, vamos a someternos a la investigación"))
E("2026-11-07", "criminal", "Carvallo abstains, says he fears for his life; pre-trial detention ordered", "Carvallo se abstiene y dice temer por su vida; se dicta su prisión preventiva", "Carvallo declines to testify on the afternoon of 7 November and tells prosecutors he fears for his life without giving details; judge Otazú orders pre-trial detention at the Agrupación Especializada on charges of breach of trust, administration for own benefit and production of false public documents.", "Carvallo se abstiene de declarar la tarde del 7 de noviembre y dice a los fiscales que teme por su vida, sin dar detalles; el juez Otazú dicta su prisión preventiva en la Agrupación Especializada por lesión de confianza, administración en provecho propio y producción de documentos públicos de contenido falso.", [CARV, OTAZU, MP], P("press", ABC8, "body", "teme por su vida", "high", "His lawyers are named without quotes; no defence position on the merits is reported."))
E("2026-11-07", "statement", "Foreign Ministry: the rule of law prevails", "Cancillería: rige el Estado de derecho", "The Foreign Ministry says in a communiqué that the rule of law prevails and that the country has mechanisms to detect and correct irregularities.", "La Cancillería dice en un comunicado que rige el Estado de derecho y que el país cuenta con mecanismos para detectar y corregir irregularidades.", [], P("press", "src:infobae-2026-11-07-prision-pena", "Foreign Ministry", "rige el Estado de derecho"))
E("2026-11-08", "criminal", "Raid on Peña's summer house in San Bernardino", "Allanamiento de la casa de veraneo de Peña en San Bernardino", "Prosecutors and police raid the house; ABC and Última Hora report a hidden armoured vault that could not be opened, while the Fiscalía's statement confirms the raid without mentioning a vault. The prosecution puts the total damage in the case at USD 809.5 million.", "Fiscales y policías allanan la vivienda; ABC y Última Hora informan de una bóveda blindada oculta que no pudo abrirse, mientras que el comunicado de la Fiscalía confirma el allanamiento sin mencionar la bóveda. La Fiscalía estima el perjuicio total de la causa en USD 809,5 millones.", [PENA, MP], P("press", "src:mercopress-2026-11-09-boveda", "body", "", "medium", "Date inferred ('Sunday'). AFP (11 Nov) reports that a vault linked to Peña was opened on 10 Nov and was empty."), 809500000, "USD")
E("2026-11-10", "criminal", "AFP: vault linked to Peña opened and found empty", "AFP: abren una bóveda vinculada a Peña y la hallan vacía", "AFP reports that a vault linked to Peña was opened on Tuesday 10 November and was empty.", "AFP informa que una bóveda vinculada a Peña fue abierta el martes 10 de noviembre y estaba vacía.", [PENA, MP], P("press", AFP11, "asset tracing", "", "medium"))
E("2026-11-08", "depositor", "Alliana orders no fines or default interest; about 1.2 million savers repaid", "Alliana dispone que no se cobren multas ni moras; cerca de 1,2 millones de ahorristas ya cobraron", "President Alliana orders that those affected not pay fines, late charges or interest arising from the crisis and says about 1.2 million savers have recovered deposits totalling about USD 158 million.", "El presidente Alliana dispone que los afectados no paguen multas, recargos ni intereses derivados de la crisis y dice que cerca de 1,2 millones de ahorristas recuperaron depósitos por unos USD 158 millones.", ["person:pedro-alliana", FGD], P("press", "src:mercopress-2026-11-09-boveda", "Alliana measures", "", "medium", "5Días: FGD released USD 158 million by 8 Nov, about 60% of payments."), 158000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-08", "criminal", "EFE summary of seizures: nine vehicles, a yacht, two aircraft, documents", "Resumen de EFE de las incautaciones: nueve vehículos, un yate, dos aeronaves, documentos", "EFE lists nine high-end vehicles found at Vázquez's Asunción residence and handed to Senabico (valued by local media at about USD 1.4 million), a yacht, two aircraft, and documents, laptops, servers and phones seized at Itti; offices of Grupo Vázquez, Technoma and Itti were raided.", "EFE lista nueve vehículos de alta gama hallados en la residencia de Vázquez en Asunción y entregados a la Senabico (valuados por medios locales en unos USD 1,4 millones), un yate, dos aeronaves, y documentos, portátiles, servidores y teléfonos incautados en Itti; se allanaron oficinas de Grupo Vázquez, Technoma e Itti.", [MV, GV, "org:technoma", "org:itti", "auth:senabico", MP], P("press", "src:efe-2026-11-08-incautaciones", "seizures", "", "high", "Dates of individual seizures are not given by EFE."), 1400000, "USD")
E("2026-11-09", "supervisory", "Senate approves Jorge Schreiner as BCP president and Fernando Rivarola for the board", "El Senado da acuerdo a Jorge Schreiner como presidente del BCP y a Fernando Rivarola para el directorio", "The Senate approves Jorge Schreiner to chair the BCP and Fernando Rivarola for the board.", "El Senado presta acuerdo a Jorge Schreiner para presidir el BCP y a Fernando Rivarola para el directorio.", [SEN, "person:jorge-schreiner", "person:fernando-rivarola", BCP], P("press", D5, "9 Nov entry"))
E("2026-11-09", "depositor", "G. 2.126 trillion paid to 1,738,804 depositors (93.1%)", "G. 2,126 billones pagados a 1.738.804 depositantes (93,1 %)", "At the close of 9 November G. 2.126 trillion had been paid to 1,738,804 depositors, about 93.1% of the total.", "Al cierre del 9 de noviembre se habían pagado G. 2,126 billones a 1.738.804 depositantes, cerca del 93,1 % del total.", [FGD, BCP], P("press", D5, "9 Nov (reported 10 Nov) entry"), 2126000000000, "PYG")
E("2026-11-09", "depositor", "AFP: about 1.7 million people recovered USD 340 million", "AFP: cerca de 1,7 millones de personas recuperaron USD 340 millones", "FGD director José Maciel says 93.1% of registered people with payable accounts have been reached; AFP gives about 1.7 million people and USD 340 million, and 1,867,000 clients eligible for the advance.", "El director del FGD, José Maciel, dice que se alcanzó al 93,1 % de las personas registradas con cuentas a pagar; AFP cifra en cerca de 1,7 millones las personas y USD 340 millones lo devuelto, y en 1.867.000 los clientes elegibles para el anticipo.", [FGD, "person:jose-maciel", BCP], P("regulator", "src:afp-2026-11-10-retornos", "payouts", "", "high", "Figures released on the evening of Monday 9 Nov per the article's wording ('Monday 10' in the tool summary is inconsistent; 9 Nov was a Monday)."), 340000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-09", "criminal", "Vázquez's three lawyers resign", "Renuncian los tres abogados de Vázquez", "Lawyers Víctor Dante Gulino, Cristóbal Cáceres and Álvaro Cáceres resign from Miguel Vázquez's defence; reasons are not given and no new lawyer is named.", "Los abogados Víctor Dante Gulino, Cristóbal Cáceres y Álvaro Cáceres renuncian a la defensa de Miguel Vázquez; no se informan motivos ni nuevo defensor.", [MV, "person:victor-dante-gulino", "person:cristobal-caceres", "person:alvaro-caceres"], P("press", "src:lanacion-2026-11-09-abogados-renuncian", "body"))
E("2026-11-09", "criminal", "Lawyers' resignation (Última Hora)", "Renuncia de los abogados (Última Hora)", "Última Hora, citing a radio station, reports the resignation on Monday 9 November and states that the reasons were not disclosed.", "Última Hora, citando a una radio, informa la renuncia el lunes 9 de noviembre y señala que las razones no se dieron a conocer.", [MV], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-09-renuncian-abogados", "body", "Las razones de la decisión no se dieron a conocer"))
E("2026-11-09", "criminal", "Prosecutors ask the Appeals Tribunal to uphold detention", "Los fiscales piden al Tribunal de Apelación ratificar la prisión", "Answering the appeal of Vázquez's defence, prosecutors Cabrera, Arce, Corbeta and Adle ask the tribunal to confirm the 5 November ruling, citing flight and obstruction risks, his economic capacity and defects in the real-estate surety offered.", "Al contestar la apelación de la defensa de Vázquez, los fiscales Cabrera, Arce, Corbeta y Adle piden confirmar la resolución del 5 de noviembre, por riesgos de fuga y obstrucción, su capacidad económica y defectos de la caución real ofrecida.", [MV, MP, TRIB, "person:francisco-cabrera", "person:jorge-arce", "person:silvio-corbeta", "person:yeimy-adle"], P("prosecution", "src:prensamercosur-2026-11-10-fiscalia-vazquez", "prosecutors' request", "", "medium", "Second-hand (Prensa Mercosur reproducing El Observador); La Nación (9 Nov) confirms the request and that the defences of Vázquez and Gustale appealed."))
E("2026-11-09", "criminal", "Raid on Ueno Casa de Bolsa; operations chief detained", "Allanamiento en Ueno Casa de Bolsa; detienen a la jefa de operaciones", "During a raid on the brokerage's offices an employee, Andrea Benítez, is detained; security cameras allegedly show her tearing up documents just before prosecutors entered.", "Durante un allanamiento a las oficinas de la casa de bolsa es detenida una funcionaria, Andrea Benítez; las cámaras de seguridad la mostrarían rompiendo documentos justo antes del ingreso de la comitiva fiscal.", ["person:andrea-benitez-garcia", "org:ueno-casa-de-bolsa", MP, "person:silvio-corbeta", "person:yeimy-adle", "person:jorge-arce"], P("prosecution", "src:abc-2026-11-10-benitez", "body", "", "medium", NOALLEG))
E("2026-11-09", "criminal", "Prosecutors announce cooperation with Luxembourg, Argentina and the United States", "La Fiscalía anuncia cooperación con Luxemburgo, Argentina y Estados Unidos", "Prosecutor Manuel Doldán says they are cooperating with authorities in Luxembourg, Argentina and the United States; prosecutors request the freezing of crypto-assets in Luxembourg after searching an Ueno office.", "El fiscal Manuel Doldán dice que cooperan con autoridades de Luxemburgo, Argentina y Estados Unidos; la Fiscalía pide el congelamiento de criptoactivos en Luxemburgo tras allanar una oficina de Ueno.", [MP, "person:manuel-doldan"], P("press", AFP11, "asset tracing", "", "high", "5Días dates the Luxembourg crypto-freeze request to 10 Nov."))
E("2026-11-10", "criminal", "Appeals Tribunal upholds detention and adds money laundering and criminal association", "El Tribunal de Apelación confirma la prisión y agrega lavado de activos y asociación criminal", "The specialised Appeals Tribunal (Luraghi, Escobar, Criscioni) confirms the detention of Vázquez, Gustale, Duarte and Gómez Abente and adds criminal association and money laundering; the list after the change includes aggravated fraud and conduct leading to bankruptcy. The tribunal reasons that Vázquez would have exercised dominant control over the bank and linked companies.", "El Tribunal de Apelaciones Especializado (Luraghi, Escobar, Criscioni) confirma la prisión de Vázquez, Gustale, Duarte y Gómez Abente y agrega asociación criminal y lavado de activos; la lista resultante incluye estafa agravada y conducta conducente a la quiebra. El tribunal razona que Vázquez habría ejercido un control dominante sobre el banco y empresas vinculadas.", [TRIB, MV, GUST, "person:diego-duarte", "person:alejandro-gomez-abente", "person:silvana-luraghi", "person:paublino-escobar", "person:claudia-criscioni"], P("press", "src:elnacional-2026-11-10-agravan-cargos", "body", "control dominante sobre Ueno Bank", "medium", "The article (published 10 Nov) does not state the date of the ruling; Última Hora says it was issued on Tuesday (10 Nov). El Nacional mentions an expected penalty of up to 15 years for Vázquez."))
E("2026-11-10", "criminal", "Última Hora: the ruling changed attempted fraud to consummated aggravated fraud", "Última Hora: el fallo cambió la tentativa de estafa por estafa consumada agravada", "Última Hora reports that the appeals ruling issued on Tuesday confirmed pre-trial detention, added money laundering and criminal association and changed attempted fraud to consummated, especially serious fraud.", "Última Hora informa que el fallo de apelación dictado el martes confirmó la prisión preventiva, agregó lavado de activos y asociación criminal y cambió la tentativa de estafa por estafa consumada, especialmente grave.", [TRIB, GUST], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-11-gustale-corte", "ruling challenged", "", "medium", "Date inferred from 'el martes'. Conflict on scope: ABC (16 Nov) lists the added offences for all eight bank defendants; La Nación (13 Nov) and ABC (19 Nov) still list the original four."))
E("2026-11-11", "statement", "Gustale's defence goes to the Supreme Court against the widened charges", "La defensa de Gustale recurre a la Corte contra la ampliación de cargos", "Lawyers Fernández Zacur and Battilana ask the Supreme Court's criminal chamber to annul the ruling, arguing that the tribunal acted as an original decision-maker, that neither the judge nor the prosecution had raised the new classification (art. 456 CPP), and that the ban on reformatio in peius and the right of defence were breached.", "Los abogados Fernández Zacur y Battilana piden a la Sala Penal de la Corte anular el fallo, alegando que el tribunal actuó como órgano de decisión originaria, que ni el juez ni la Fiscalía habían planteado la nueva calificación (art. 456 CPP) y que se violaron la prohibición de reforma en perjuicio y el derecho de defensa.", [GUST, "person:jose-miguel-fernandez-zacur", "person:marcio-battilana", "auth:corte-suprema-sala-penal", TRIB], P("defence", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-11-gustale-corte", "defence arguments", "el tribunal no actuó como órgano revisor", "high", "Filing date not stated (reported 11 Nov). No ruling by the Supreme Court was found as of 20 Nov."))
E("2026-11-10", "criminal", "Casa de Bolsa employee appears before prosecutors and is to be charged", "La funcionaria de la casa de bolsa comparece ante la Fiscalía y será imputada", "Andrea Benítez appears before the Fiscalía; prosecutor Federico Leguizamón says she will be charged that day with frustration of criminal prosecution. Per ABC she said the torn papers were unsigned draft resolutions and contracts.", "Andrea Benítez comparece ante la Fiscalía; el fiscal Federico Leguizamón dice que será imputada ese día por frustración de la persecución y ejecución penal. Según ABC, dijo que los papeles rotos eran proyectos de resoluciones y contratos sin firmar.", ["person:andrea-benitez-garcia", "person:federico-leguizamon", MP], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-10-benitez", "body", "", "medium", "The headline says she 'abstained' while the body says she declared briefly."))
E("2026-11-10", "criminal", "IPS files a criminal complaint over USD 516 million", "El IPS presenta denuncia penal por USD 516 millones", "The social security institute files a complaint asking prosecutors to trace USD 516 million it had deposited at the bank.", "El Instituto de Previsión Social presenta una denuncia pidiendo rastrear USD 516 millones que había depositado en el banco.", ["org:ips", MP, UB], P("press", AFP11, "pension funds", "", "high", "Conflict on IPS exposure: about USD 345-380 million reported on 3 Nov (Revista Foco, AP)."), 516000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-10", "criminal", "Former economy minister's residence searched (AFP: 10 November)", "Allanan la residencia del exministro de Economía (AFP: 10 de noviembre)", "AFP reports that the residence of former economy minister Carlos Fernández Valdovinos was searched on 10 November in an inquiry over about USD 40 million of Caja Fiscal funds held at Ueno.", "AFP informa que la residencia del exministro de Economía Carlos Fernández Valdovinos fue allanada el 10 de noviembre en una pesquisa por unos USD 40 millones de la Caja Fiscal depositados en Ueno.", ["person:carlos-fernandez-valdovinos", MP], P("press", AFP11, "Caja Fiscal", "", "medium", "Conflict on date: 5Días lists the raid under 11 Nov. ABC (16 Nov): investigated, not charged."), 40000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-11", "criminal", "5Días: raid on the former economy minister's home listed under 11 November", "5Días: el allanamiento al exministro de Economía figura el 11 de noviembre", "5Días lists the raid on Fernández Valdovinos's home and his removal from the Itaipú board under 11 November.", "5Días ubica el allanamiento de la casa de Fernández Valdovinos y su remoción del consejo de Itaipú el 11 de noviembre.", ["person:carlos-fernandez-valdovinos"], P("press", D5, "11 Nov entry", "", "medium", "Conflict on date: AFP says Tuesday 10 Nov."))
E("2026-11-10", "depositor", "1,782,360 people paid; 1,824,994 funded accounts", "1.782.360 personas pagadas; 1.824.994 cuentas con saldo", "BCP board member Pedro Acosta says that excluding zero-balance accounts there are 1,824,994 accounts; about 1,782,360 people (97.66% of the first-stage target) have received about USD 355 million.", "El director del BCP Pedro Acosta dice que, excluidas las cuentas con saldo cero, quedan 1.824.994 cuentas; unas 1.782.360 personas (97,66 % de la meta de la primera etapa) recibieron unos USD 355 millones.", [BCP, "person:pedro-acosta", FGD], P("regulator", AFP11, "payouts", "muchísimas cuentas con saldo cero"), 355000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-10", "depositor", "AFP: guarantee fund expected to cover about USD 740 million", "AFP: se espera que el fondo de garantía cubra unos USD 740 millones", "AFP reports that the guarantee fund is expected to cover about USD 740 million, roughly 27% of total deposits of about USD 2.8 billion.", "AFP informa que se espera que el fondo de garantía cubra unos USD 740 millones, cerca del 27 % de los depósitos totales de unos USD 2.800 millones.", [FGD, UB], P("press", AFP11, "expected cost", "", "medium", "Conflict: Global Finance (12 Nov) cites preliminary central bank estimates of up to USD 928 million, 58% of the fund."), 740000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-12", "depositor", "Global Finance: payouts could consume up to USD 928 million of the fund", "Global Finance: los pagos podrían consumir hasta USD 928 millones del fondo", "Global Finance, citing preliminary central bank estimates, says payouts could consume up to USD 928 million (58%) of the fund, leaving about USD 672 million; about G. 3.9 trillion (USD 644 million) had been paid to more than 1.8 million depositors.", "Global Finance, citando estimaciones preliminares del banco central, dice que los pagos podrían consumir hasta USD 928 millones (58 %) del fondo, dejando unos USD 672 millones; se habían pagado unos G. 3,9 billones (USD 644 millones) a más de 1,8 millones de depositantes.", [FGD, BCP], P("press", "src:gfmag-2026-11-12-fgd", "body", "", "medium", "Conflict: AFP gives about USD 740 million. The article's image caption reads '$347M' while the body says USD 644 million."), 928000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-10", "market", "Ueno AFPISA's authorisation suspended for 180 days", "Suspenden por 180 días la autorización de Ueno AFPISA", "The Superintendency of Securities suspends the authorisation of Ueno AFPISA for 180 consecutive days; an affected-investors group says about 30,000 investors cannot access about USD 46 million.", "La Superintendencia de Valores suspende por 180 días corridos la autorización de Ueno AFPISA; un grupo de afectados dice que unos 30.000 inversores no pueden acceder a unos USD 46 millones.", [SIV, "org:ueno-afpisa"], P("press", EFE15, "Ueno AFPISA", "", "high", "Investor and amount figures come from the affected-investors group."), 46000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-10", "statement", "Cadiem's fund-administrator president warns of lost confidence in the supervisor", "El presidente de la administradora de Cadiem advierte sobre la pérdida de confianza en el supervisor", "César Paredes says the loss of confidence in the Superintendency of Banks is one of the most worrying consequences of the crisis; 345 investors ask for information on the funds' exposure to Ueno.", "César Paredes dice que la pérdida de confianza en la Superintendencia de Bancos es una de las consecuencias más preocupantes de la crisis; 345 inversores piden información sobre la exposición de los fondos a Ueno.", ["org:cadiem", "person:cesar-paredes", SIB], P("company", "src:5dias-2026-11-10-cadiem", "summary", "", "medium", "Paywalled; only the summary was readable. ABC (11 Nov) puts the investor group at more than 500."))

# 11-13 November
E("2026-11-11", "criminal", "Pre-trial detention ordered for the Casa de Bolsa operations chief", "Prisión preventiva para la jefa de operaciones de la casa de bolsa", "Judge Marcelo Saldívar orders pre-trial detention of Andrea Benítez after prosecutors, who had first asked for lighter measures, requested detention at the hearing.", "El juez Marcelo Saldívar dicta prisión preventiva para Andrea Benítez luego de que la Fiscalía, que primero pidió medidas menos gravosas, solicitara prisión en la audiencia.", ["person:andrea-benitez-garcia", "person:marcelo-saldivar", MP], P("press", "src:riotimes-2026-11-11-benitez", "detention", "", "medium", "Single English-language aggregator for the judge's name and date; ABC (16 Nov) confirms she was in pre-trial detention."))
E("2026-11-11", "statement", "Benítez's lawyer: she had already cooperated; the prosecution's account is 'fanciful'", "Abogado de Benítez: ya había colaborado; la versión fiscal es 'fantasiosa'", "Lawyer Andrés Álvarez says his client had already cooperated and handed over documents and calls the prosecution's account fanciful.", "El abogado Andrés Álvarez dice que su clienta ya había colaborado y entregado documentos y califica de fantasiosa la versión de la Fiscalía.", ["person:andrea-benitez-garcia", "person:andres-alvarez"], P("defence", "src:riotimes-2026-11-11-benitez", "defence", "fantasiosa", "medium"))
E("2026-11-11", "market", "Fitch places Paraguay's BB+ rating on negative watch", "Fitch coloca la calificación BB+ de Paraguay en vigilancia negativa", "Fitch places the sovereign rating on negative watch citing the fallout from Ueno's collapse and the political upheaval, while not presently anticipating broader financial-stability risks; it flags downside risks to its 4.5% growth forecast.", "Fitch coloca la calificación soberana en vigilancia negativa por las secuelas de la caída de Ueno y la crisis política, aunque no prevé por ahora riesgos más amplios para la estabilidad financiera; advierte riesgos a la baja para su previsión de crecimiento de 4,5 %.", ["org:fitch"], P("rating_agency", "src:reuters-2026-11-11-fitch-watch", "body", "Fitch does not presently anticipate broader financial stability risks"))
E("2026-11-11", "market", "Fitch watch on the sovereign (Diario HOY)", "Vigilancia de Fitch sobre el soberano (Diario HOY)", "HOY reports the same action and adds that Fitch sees the Ueno crisis adding to structural fiscal difficulties.", "HOY informa la misma acción y agrega que Fitch considera que la crisis de ueno se suma a dificultades fiscales estructurales.", ["org:fitch"], P("rating_agency", "src:hoy-2026-11-11-fitch", "body", "la crisis de ueno se suma a las dificultades fiscales estructurales"))
E("2026-11-11", "market", "Regulator orders CAVAPY to transfer Ueno Casa de Bolsa portfolios", "El regulador ordena a CAVAPY traspasar las carteras de Ueno Casa de Bolsa", "The Superintendency of Securities orders the securities depository to transfer the portfolios of Ueno Casa de Bolsa; Ueno AFPISA funds stay suspended.", "La Superintendencia de Valores ordena a la caja de valores traspasar las carteras de Ueno Casa de Bolsa; los fondos de Ueno AFPISA siguen suspendidos.", [SIV, "org:ueno-casa-de-bolsa", "org:ueno-afpisa"], P("press", D5, "11 Nov entry"))
E("2026-11-11", "market", "OTP books a USD 32 million negative fair-value adjustment", "OTP registra un ajuste negativo de valor razonable de USD 32 millones", "OTP's third-quarter report includes a USD 32 million negative fair-value correction on the stake; deputy CEO László Bencsik says OTP did not know about the problems, and neither did the regulator.", "El informe del tercer trimestre de OTP incluye una corrección negativa de valor razonable de USD 32 millones sobre la participación; el director general adjunto László Bencsik dice que OTP no sabía de los problemas, y el regulador tampoco.", ["org:otp-bank", "person:laszlo-bencsik", "org:u-holdings"], P("company", "src:vg-2026-11-11-otp", "body", "Nem tudtunk a problémákról, és a szabályozó sem tudott róluk"), 32000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-11", "corporate", "Two managers of U Holdings leave; departure registered in Luxembourg", "Dos gerentes de U Holdings se dan de baja; salida inscrita en Luxemburgo", "The Luxembourg register processes on 11 November the departure of two category B managers of u Holdings Sàrl.", "El registro de Luxemburgo procesa el 11 de noviembre la baja de dos gerentes de categoría B de u Holdings Sàrl.", ["org:u-holdings"], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-12-luxemburgo-salida", "body", "", "high", "The two managers are not parties to the case and are not named here."))
E("2026-11-11", "depositor", "By the legal deadline 1,812,348 people had received G. 3.9 trillion", "Al vencer el plazo legal, 1.812.348 personas habían recibido G. 3,9 billones", "EFE reports that by the deadline set by Law 7745/2026 1,812,348 people had received funds totalling G. 3.9 trillion (about USD 644 million); on that day G. 1.7 trillion was paid to 29,988 people, mainly certificate-of-deposit holders.", "EFE informa que al vencer el plazo de la Ley 7745/2026 1.812.348 personas habían recibido fondos por G. 3,9 billones (unos USD 644 millones); ese día se pagaron G. 1,7 billones a 29.988 personas, principalmente titulares de CDA.", [FGD, BCP], P("press", EFE15, "payouts", "", "high", "The article says the deadline fell 'on Wednesday' (11 Nov by calendar)."), 3900000000000, "PYG")
E("2026-11-11", "market", "Cadiem publishes a staged redemption schedule; investor group demands disclosure", "Cadiem difunde un cronograma escalonado de rescates; un grupo de inversores exige información", "Cadiem says the regulator approved the schedule: earlier requests paid 6-16 November and requests of 9-13 November paid 17-23 November, with a 5% limit for holders of more than 20 units; a group of more than 500 investors asks which funds held Ueno-linked instruments and for a correction of the 6 November notice.", "Cadiem dice que el regulador aprobó el cronograma: pedidos anteriores se pagan del 6 al 16 de noviembre y los del 9 al 13 de noviembre, del 17 al 23, con un tope del 5 % para tenedores de más de 20 cuotas; un grupo de más de 500 inversores pide saber qué fondos tenían instrumentos vinculados a Ueno y rectificar el comunicado del 6 de noviembre.", ["org:cadiem", SIV], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-11-inversores-cadiem", "body", "El Fondo de Garantía no cubre fondos mutuos", "high", "The article's summary and body give slightly different dates for the earliest payments. Conflict on group size: 345 investors (5Días, 10 Nov)."))
E("2026-11-10", "criminal", "Última Hora: prosecutor Corbeta requests Astigarraga's detention", "Última Hora: el fiscal Corbeta pide la detención de Astigarraga", "Última Hora reports that on Tuesday prosecutor Silvio Corbeta requested the detention of César Astigarraga, until then a charged person at liberty, and that a credit company's premises linked to him were raided.", "Última Hora informa que el martes el fiscal Silvio Corbeta pidió la detención de César Astigarraga, hasta entonces imputado en libertad, y que se allanó la sede de una casa de créditos vinculada a él.", ["person:cesar-astigarraga", "person:silvio-corbeta", MP], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-11-astigarraga", "body", "", "medium", "Conflict: ABC says a detention order had been in force since 5 Nov. Date inferred from 'este martes' (published 11 Nov 07:45). No defence statement in the article."))
E("2026-11-12", "criminal", "Astigarraga presents himself; pre-trial detention ordered (ABC, 19 Nov version)", "Astigarraga se presenta; se dicta su prisión preventiva (ABC, versión del 19/11)", "César Astigarraga presents himself on 12 November at the economic-crimes unit of the Ministerio Público; per ABC on 19 November, judge Rodrigo Estigarribia ordered pre-trial detention that day and he is held at the Martín Mendoza maximum-security prison in Emboscada.", "César Astigarraga se presenta el 12 de noviembre en la unidad de delitos económicos del Ministerio Público; según ABC del 19 de noviembre, el juez Rodrigo Estigarribia dictó ese día su prisión preventiva y está recluido en la cárcel de máxima seguridad Martín Mendoza, en Emboscada.", ["person:cesar-astigarraga", JUDGE, MP], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-19-astigarraga-recurso", "body", "", "medium", "Conflict: the 12 Nov ABC report (via Prensa Mercosur) names judge Osmar Legal and ex-Tacumbú; see next row."))
E("2026-11-12", "criminal", "Astigarraga's detention as first reported: judge Osmar Legal, ex-Tacumbú, widened offences", "La prisión de Astigarraga según el primer reporte: juez Osmar Legal, ex-Tacumbú, hechos ampliados", "The 12 November report says judge Osmar Legal ordered pre-trial detention at the Centro Nacional de Prevenidos with a ban on contact with the other bank defendants, for money laundering, aggravated fraud, improper conduct in crisis, breach of trust and criminal association; it cites loans of G. 252,521,261,384 to Grupo Hendy and G. 237,105,585,238 to Grupo M from the charges.", "El reporte del 12 de noviembre dice que el juez Osmar Legal dictó prisión preventiva en el Centro Nacional de Prevenidos con prohibición de contacto con los demás exdirectivos, por lavado de activos, estafa agravada, conducta indebida en situación de crisis, lesión de confianza y asociación criminal; cita créditos por G. 252.521.261.384 a Grupo Hendy y G. 237.105.585.238 a Grupo M según la imputación.", ["person:cesar-astigarraga", "person:osmar-legal", "org:grupo-hendy", "org:grupo-m", "org:itti"], P("press", "src:prensamercosur-2026-11-12-astigarraga", "body", "", "medium", "Second-hand (Prensa Mercosur reproducing ABC). Conflicts with ABC 19 Nov on judge (Estigarribia), place (Martín Mendoza) and offences (original four). " + NOALLEG), 252521261384, "PYG")
E("2026-11-12", "statement", "Astigarraga's lawyer: voluntary surrender disproves flight risk", "Abogado de Astigarraga: la presentación voluntaria desvirtúa el peligro de fuga", "Lawyer Christian Bernal argues that Astigarraga presented himself of his own will and that there are no valid grounds for pre-trial detention.", "El abogado Christian Bernal sostiene que Astigarraga se presentó por voluntad propia y que no existen fundamentos valederos para la prisión preventiva.", ["person:cesar-astigarraga", "person:christian-bernal"], P("defence", "src:abc-2026-11-19-astigarraga-recurso", "defence", "fundamentos valederos", "medium", "Argument as summarised in the 19 Nov article on the appeal; exact date of the statement not given."))
E("2026-11-12", "criminal", "Superintendent of Banks Holger Insfrán detained and charged", "Detienen e imputan al superintendente de Bancos Holger Insfrán", "Insfrán is detained on 12 November and charged with aggravated breach of trust in case N.º 92; prosecutors request pre-trial detention and the freezing of assets and accounts.", "Insfrán es detenido el 12 de noviembre e imputado por lesión de confianza agravada en la causa N.º 92; la Fiscalía pide su prisión preventiva y el bloqueo de bienes y cuentas.", [INSF, MP, SIB], P("press", "src:lanacion-2026-11-13-pena-carvallo-bcp", "persons investigated", "", "high", "No statement from Insfrán or his defence is reported in any page opened (La Nación, MercoPress/EFE, Prensa Mercosur/ABC). " + NOALLEG))
E("2026-11-12", "criminal", "MercoPress/EFE on Insfrán's arrest", "MercoPress/EFE sobre el arresto de Insfrán", "MercoPress, citing prosecution sources via EFE, reports the arrest on Thursday 12 November without disclosing charges.", "MercoPress, citando fuentes fiscales vía EFE, informa el arresto el jueves 12 de noviembre sin precisar los cargos.", [INSF], P("press", "src:mercopress-2026-11-12-insfran", "body", "", "medium"))
E("2026-11-12", "supervisory", "BCP estimates about USD 600 million of healthy assets", "El BCP estima unos USD 600 millones en activos sanos", "The BCP reports a preliminary estimate of about USD 600 million of healthy assets; BCP president Jorge Schreiner says they could cover pension funds and that assets will be tendered in lots.", "El BCP informa una estimación preliminar de unos USD 600 millones en activos sanos; el presidente del BCP, Jorge Schreiner, dice que podrían cubrir a los fondos previsionales y que los activos se licitarán por lotes.", [BCP, "person:jorge-schreiner", UB], P("regulator", D5, "12 Nov entry", "", "medium", "Schreiner's statements per EFE (15 Nov) and La Nación (12 Nov)."), 600000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-12", "depositor", "Intervention team waives default and penalty interest until 30 November", "El equipo interventor exonera intereses moratorios y punitorios hasta el 30 de noviembre", "The BCP intervention team waives default and penalty interest on loans, credit cards and other credit operations of Ueno Bank clients for obligations due until 30 November 2026.", "El Equipo Interventor del BCP exonera de intereses moratorios y punitorios a préstamos, tarjetas y otras operaciones crediticias de clientes de Ueno Bank por obligaciones pendientes hasta el 30 de noviembre de 2026.", [BCP, UB], P("regulator", "src:lanacion-2026-11-12-exonera-intereses", "body"))
E("2026-11-12", "criminal", "Presidential residence raided; prosecutors meet Luxembourg counterparts", "Allanan la residencia presidencial; fiscales se reúnen con pares de Luxemburgo", "Investigators raid the official presidential residence in Asunción; prosecutor Francisco Cabrera reports a preliminary meeting with Luxembourg prosecutors on a possible formal cooperation request.", "Los investigadores allanan la residencia presidencial oficial en Asunción; el fiscal Francisco Cabrera informa de una reunión preliminar con fiscales de Luxemburgo sobre un eventual pedido formal de cooperación.", [MP, "person:francisco-cabrera", PENA], P("press", "src:aljazeera-2026-11-13-pena", "raid", "", "medium", "Luxembourg meeting per Primicias/AFP (13 Nov)."))
E("2026-11-13", "criminal", "Charges against Peña widened to criminal association (acta N.º 9)", "Amplían la imputación contra Peña por asociación criminal (acta N.º 9)", "By acta de imputación N.º 9 the prosecution adds criminal association as author, alleging that from the Presidency Peña acted as head of the structure; the offence is also added for Carvallo and Insfrán.", "Por acta de imputación N.º 9 la Fiscalía agrega asociación criminal en calidad de autor, sosteniendo que desde la Presidencia Peña habría actuado como jefe de la estructura; el hecho punible se agrega también para Carvallo e Insfrán.", [PENA, CARV, INSF, MP], P("prosecution", ABC13, "body", "habría recibido personalmente contraprestaciones ilícitas", "high", NOALLEG + " The article carries no statement from any defence; the matching defence row follows."))
E("2026-11-13", "statement", "Peña denies all charges; no lawyer's response to the new charge reported", "Peña niega todos los cargos; no se reporta respuesta de sus abogados al nuevo cargo", "Al Jazeera, with AFP and Reuters, reports that Peña denies all charges. No statement by his lawyers on the criminal-association charge was found in the pages opened.", "Al Jazeera, con AFP y Reuters, informa que Peña niega todos los cargos. No se halló declaración de sus abogados sobre el cargo de asociación criminal en las páginas abiertas.", [PENA], P("defence", "src:aljazeera-2026-11-13-pena", "Peña's response", "", "medium", "General denial relayed by wire copy; earlier detailed defence positions are in the rows of 6 and 7 Nov."))
E("2026-11-13", "criminal", "Three former BCP directors detained and charged", "Detienen e imputan a tres exdirectores del BCP", "Liana Caballero and Miguel Ángel Mora are detained and Marco Aurelio González presents himself; all are charged with aggravated breach of trust and criminal association, González also with false-public-document offences. Prosecutors request house arrest with ankle monitor for Caballero and Mora and pre-trial detention for González.", "Liana Caballero y Miguel Ángel Mora son detenidos y Marco Aurelio González se presenta; todos son imputados por lesión de confianza grave y asociación criminal, González además por hechos de documentos públicos de contenido falso. La Fiscalía pide arresto domiciliario con tobillera para Caballero y Mora y prisión preventiva para González.", ["person:liana-caballero", "person:miguel-angel-mora", "person:marco-aurelio-gonzalez", MP, BCP, OTAZU], P("prosecution", ABC13, "persons charged", "consentido deliberadamente", "high", NOALLEG + " No defence statements reported. Conflict: ABC (16 Nov) lists all three in pre-trial detention."))
E("2026-11-13", "criminal", "Where González presented himself: two versions", "Dónde se presentó González: dos versiones", "La Nación says González presented himself at the 1st police station in Sajonia; La Política Online says he surrendered after 08:00 at the police Organised Crime directorate with his lawyer.", "La Nación dice que González se presentó en la Comisaría 1.ª de Sajonia; La Política Online dice que se entregó después de las 08:00 en la Dirección de Crimen Organizado de la Policía, con su abogado.", ["person:marco-aurelio-gonzalez"], P("press", "src:lpo-2026-11-13-excupula-bcp", "González", "", "low", "Conflict between La Nación (13 Nov) and La Política Online (13 Nov) on the place."))
E("2026-11-13", "statement", "Prosecutor on Caballero: she failed in her legal duty of control", "Fiscal sobre Caballero: faltó a su deber legal de control", "Prosecutor Ruth Benítez says of Liana Caballero that she did not raise the alert and failed in her duty.", "La fiscal Ruth Benítez dice de Liana Caballero que no alertó y faltó a su deber.", ["person:liana-caballero", "person:ruth-benitez"], P("prosecution", "src:lpo-2026-11-13-excupula-bcp", "prosecutor statement", "No alertó y faltó a su deber", "medium", NOALLEG + " No response from Caballero or her defence was found."))
E("2026-11-13", "criminal", "Court freezes assets and accounts of the three former BCP directors", "El juzgado inhibe bienes y embarga cuentas de los tres exdirectores del BCP", "A court grants the prosecution's request for a general inhibition on disposing of assets and a preventive embargo on the bank accounts of Caballero, González and Mora.", "Un juzgado hace lugar al pedido fiscal de inhibición general de enajenar y gravar bienes y embargo preventivo de las cuentas de Caballero, González y Mora.", ["person:liana-caballero", "person:marco-aurelio-gonzalez", "person:miguel-angel-mora", MP], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-14-inhibir-bcp", "body", "", "high", "Court not identified in the article; no defence statements."))
E("2026-11-13", "criminal", "Prosecutors: several countries confirm assets; freeze requests being prepared", "Fiscalía: varios países confirman activos; se preparan pedidos de congelamiento", "Prosecutor Francisco Cabrera says several countries, which he does not name, have confirmed the presence of assets and that steps are under way to request their freezing.", "El fiscal Francisco Cabrera dice que varios países, que no identifica, confirmaron la presencia de activos y que se preparan diligencias para pedir su congelamiento.", [MP, "person:francisco-cabrera"], P("prosecution", "src:primicias-2026-11-13-activos", "press conference", "ya han contestado en forma afirmativa la presencia de activos", "high", "No foreign freeze is confirmed in any page opened."))
E("2026-11-13", "supervisory", "BCP temporarily cuts reserve requirements by five points", "El BCP reduce temporalmente el encaje legal en cinco puntos", "The BCP announces a temporary five-point cut in reserve requirements; freed funds may be used only to buy back or purchase certificates of deposit or financial bonds.", "El BCP anuncia una reducción temporal de cinco puntos del encaje legal; los fondos liberados solo pueden usarse para recomprar o comprar CDA o bonos financieros.", [BCP], P("regulator", EFE15, "reserve requirement", "", "high", "Date from 5Días (13 Nov); EFE says 'on Friday'."))
E("2026-11-13", "depositor", "IPS reports USD 517 million committed at Ueno", "El IPS informa USD 517 millones comprometidos en Ueno", "The IPS reports USD 517 million committed at Ueno and warns that pension income may last only until 2032.", "El IPS informa USD 517 millones comprometidos en Ueno y advierte que los ingresos previsionales podrían alcanzar solo hasta 2032.", ["org:ips", UB], P("press", D5, "13 Nov entry", "", "medium", "Conflict: the same special cites September records of USD 348.5 million; other outlets give USD 345-380 million (3 Nov) and USD 500 million (Extra, 20 Nov)."), 517000000, "USD")
E("2026-11-13", "market", "Sovereign bonds fall between 2 and 13 November", "Los bonos soberanos caen entre el 2 y el 13 de noviembre", "MEF quotations: the 2050 bond falls from 85.64 to 83.08 (yield 6.65% to 6.90%), the 2044 from 95.46 to 93.01 (6.57% to 6.83%), the 2036 from 100.23 to 98.24 and the 2031 from 97.72 to 96.89; the article cautions that global conditions also play a part.", "Cotizaciones del MEF: el bono 2050 cae de 85,64 a 83,08 (rendimiento de 6,65 % a 6,90 %), el 2044 de 95,46 a 93,01 (6,57 % a 6,83 %), el 2036 de 100,23 a 98,24 y el 2031 de 97,72 a 96,89; la nota advierte que también influyen las condiciones globales.", ["auth:mef"], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-14-bonos-soberanos", "table"))
E("2026-11-14", "market", "Bloomberg: Ueno's international bonds fall to about 5 cents; sovereign risk at 134 bp", "Bloomberg: los bonos internacionales de Ueno caen a unos 5 centavos; riesgo soberano en 134 pb", "Bloomberg reports that Ueno's international bonds began November above 85 cents on the dollar and fell to about 5 cents, and that sovereign risk rose about 30 basis points since September to 134; an adviser says Paraguayan corporate issuers are effectively shut out of global markets.", "Bloomberg informa que los bonos internacionales de Ueno comenzaron noviembre por encima de 85 centavos por dólar y cayeron a unos 5, y que el riesgo soberano subió unos 30 puntos básicos desde septiembre, a 134; un asesor dice que los emisores corporativos paraguayos quedaron de hecho fuera de los mercados globales.", [UB], P("press", "src:bloomberglinea-2026-11-14-reputacion", "bond prices", "", "high", "No specific dates are given for the price fall."))
