E("2026-11-16", "criminal", "ABC count: 17 people deprived of liberty in the two cases", "Recuento de ABC: 17 personas privadas de libertad en las dos causas", "ABC counts ten people deprived of liberty in Causa 89/2026 (the eight bank defendants, Astigarraga and the brokerage employee) and seven in Causa 92/2026 (Peña, Carvallo, Insfrán, González, Caballero, Mora and BCP legal director Aldo Rodríguez); 18 other company-linked defendants remain at liberty.", "ABC cuenta diez personas privadas de libertad en la Causa 89/2026 (los ocho del banco, Astigarraga y la funcionaria de la casa de bolsa) y siete en la Causa 92/2026 (Peña, Carvallo, Insfrán, González, Caballero, Mora y el director jurídico del BCP Aldo Rodríguez); otros 18 imputados de empresas vinculadas siguen en libertad.", EIGHT + ["person:cesar-astigarraga", "person:andrea-benitez-garcia", PENA, CARV, INSF, "person:marco-aurelio-gonzalez", "person:liana-caballero", "person:miguel-angel-mora", "person:aldo-rodriguez"], P("press", ABC16, "totals", "", "high", "The article gives no detention dates, judges or next hearings for most people. It lists the widened offences for all eight bank defendants."))
