E("2026-11-18", "statement", "Julio Rey gives a voluntary statement to prosecutors (18 November per El Nacional)", "Julio Rey declara voluntariamente ante la Fiscalía (18 de noviembre según El Nacional)", "El Nacional reports that Rey, at his defence's formal request, gave an extended voluntary statement on Wednesday 18 November, the only member of the former board to do so.", "El Nacional informa que Rey, a pedido formal de su defensa, prestó una extensa declaración voluntaria el miércoles 18 de noviembre, siendo el único integrante del antiguo directorio en hacerlo.", [REY, MP, "person:guillermo-ferreiro"], P("press", ELN19, "body", "", "medium", "Conflict on date: Extra (20 Nov) says he declared 'el pasado martes' (17 Nov). This press-reported statement is distinct from the statement in the prosecution record (pp. 19-24)."))
