E("2026-11-18", "statement", "Content of Rey's statement as reported: suspicious deposits, extraordinary operations, linked companies, real estate", "Contenido de la declaración de Rey según lo publicado: depósitos sospechosos, operaciones extraordinarias, empresas vinculadas, inmuebles", "As reported, Rey gave information on suspicious deposits allegedly meant to strengthen the bank's capital and liquidity, operations of extraordinary amounts, movements with linked companies and real estate to be verified, and handed over documents on the bank's internal workings, balance sheets and financial decisions. No amounts or company names are given.", "Según lo publicado, Rey aportó información sobre depósitos sospechosos que habrían buscado fortalecer el capital y la liquidez del banco, operaciones de montos extraordinarios, movimientos con empresas vinculadas e inmuebles a verificar, y entregó documentos sobre el funcionamiento interno, los balances y las decisiones financieras. No se dan montos ni nombres de empresas.", [REY, UB], P("rey", ELN19, "what he declared", "", "medium", "Second-hand press account (via his lawyer) of a statement by a charged person; not the record's statement. Untested assertions."))
E("2026-11-18", "statement", "Rey statement (1000 Noticias): deposits used to show greater capital backing", "Declaración de Rey (1000 Noticias): depósitos para aparentar mayor respaldo de capital", "1000 Noticias reports that, according to what was put to the Fiscalía, some deposits would have served to show greater capital backing and give liquidity to a bank in difficulty.", "1000 Noticias informa que, según lo expuesto ante la Fiscalía, algunos depósitos habrían servido para aparentar mayor respaldo de capital y dar liquidez a un banco con dificultades.", [REY, UB], P("rey", "src:1000noticias-2026-11-20-rey", "body", "", "medium", "This article does not give the date of the statement. Second-hand; untested."))
E("2026-11-18", "statement", "Rey reveals an internal report called 'Delirio Colectivo'", "Rey revela un informe interno llamado 'Delirio Colectivo'", "Rey is reported to have revealed an internal report called 'Delirio Colectivo'; after it became known, two board members who had begun to question matters were removed from their posts.", "Se informa que Rey reveló un informe interno llamado 'Delirio Colectivo'; tras conocerse, dos miembros del directorio que empezaron a cuestionar lo expuesto fueron apartados de sus cargos.", [REY, UB], P("rey", ELN19, "Delirio Colectivo", "Delirio Colectivo", "medium", "No outlet opened names the author, the date or the two directors, or calls it an email. 1000 Noticias gives a slightly different sequence (the two were removed after the document was drawn up)."))
E("2026-11-18", "statement", "Rey's lawyer: real liquidity problems existed; Rey did not know the 'informe Rivarola'", "Abogado de Rey: había problemas reales de liquidez; Rey desconocía el 'informe Rivarola'", "Guillermo Ferreiro says Rey flagged situations, asked for reports and got unsatisfactory answers; that the bank had real liquidity problems before its fall and Rey knew of internal reports urging corrective measures but not the BCP's 'informe Rivarola'; and that Rey had been removed from the board before the 3 November announcement and then worked at another group company.", "Guillermo Ferreiro dice que Rey advirtió situaciones, pidió informes y recibió respuestas insatisfactorias; que el banco tenía problemas reales de liquidez antes de su caída y Rey conocía informes internos que pedían medidas correctivas pero no el 'informe Rivarola' del BCP; y que Rey fue apartado del directorio antes del anuncio del 3 de noviembre y luego trabajó en otra empresa del grupo.", [REY, "person:guillermo-ferreiro", UB], P("defence", ELN19, "lawyer's statements", "Rey está dispuesto a colaborar con la investigación", "medium", "Extra adds that he left the board four months before the intervention."))
E("2026-11-18", "statement", "Rey's lawyer: he will answer for what he did, not for what he did not do", "Abogado de Rey: responderá por lo que hizo, no por lo que no hizo", "Ferreiro says his client will take responsibility for what he has to and wanted people to recover their money; he acknowledges the defence is seeking a cooperation agreement ('colaboración premiada') and guarantees, and may later ask for house arrest.", "Ferreiro dice que su cliente asumirá la responsabilidad por lo que tenga que asumir y que quería que la gente recupere su plata; reconoce que la defensa busca una 'colaboración premiada' y garantías, y que luego podrían pedir prisión domiciliaria.", [REY, "person:guillermo-ferreiro"], P("defence", EXTRA, "lawyer's statements", "Él asumirá la responsabilidad por lo que tenga que asumir", "medium", "No cooperation agreement has been concluded. Extra also relays an unconfirmed list of cash withdrawals shown by a senator; the outlet itself calls it unconfirmed and it is not recorded here."))
E("2026-11-18", "statement", "Rey's lawyer on the documents and prison conditions", "El abogado de Rey sobre los documentos y las condiciones de reclusión", "Speaking to a radio station, Ferreiro calls the documents handed over the end of the thread and says Rey receives no special treatment in prison.", "En declaraciones radiales, Ferreiro describe los documentos entregados como la punta del hilo y dice que Rey no recibe trato diferenciado en prisión.", [REY, "person:guillermo-ferreiro"], P("defence", "src:rdn-2026-11-20-rey", "lawyer's statements", "Cero privilegio; él entiende la situación", "medium", "Second-hand (RDN citing ABC Color / ABC Cardinal)."))
