E("2026-11-19", "criminal", "Appeals Tribunal declares Astigarraga's appeal inadmissible", "El Tribunal de Apelación declara inadmisible el recurso de Astigarraga", "The first chamber of the specialised Appeals Tribunal (Criscioni, Luraghi, Fleitas) declares the defence appeal inadmissible because its grievances do not allege an error in applying substantive or procedural criminal law; pre-trial detention stands.", "La primera sala del Tribunal de Apelación Especializado (Criscioni, Luraghi, Fleitas) declara inadmisible el recurso de la defensa porque sus agravios no alegan un error en la aplicación del derecho penal material o procesal; la prisión preventiva se mantiene.", ["person:cesar-astigarraga", TRIB, "person:claudia-criscioni", "person:silvana-luraghi", "person:arnaldo-fleitas"], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-19-astigarraga-recurso", "decision", "", "high", "The article lists the original four offences for Astigarraga and asserts, in the outlet's own voice, that about USD 1.2 billion of public funds stayed with the bank."))
