E("2026-11-19", "criminal", "Legislators file a criminal complaint against former Attorney General Rolón", "Legisladoras denuncian penalmente al exfiscal general Rolón", "Senator Yolanda Paredes and deputy Rocío Vallejo file a complaint alleging frustration of prosecution, influence peddling, criminal association and omission, citing raid orders of 5 November executed four to five days late and the raid on GSR Security almost 15 days into the crisis.", "La senadora Yolanda Paredes y la diputada Rocío Vallejo presentan una denuncia por frustración de la persecución penal, tráfico de influencias, asociación criminal y omisión, citando órdenes de allanamiento del 5 de noviembre ejecutadas con cuatro a cinco días de demora y el allanamiento a GSR Security casi 15 días después del inicio de la crisis.", ["person:emiliano-rolon", "person:yolanda-paredes", "person:rocio-vallejo", MP, "org:gsr"], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-19-denuncia-rolon", "body", "inacción y demora injustificada", "high", "Allegations by the complainants; the article includes no statement or response from Rolón, so no matching defence row exists. Presumption of innocence applies."))
E("2026-11-19", "statement", "OTP defends its investment and cites unforeseeable problems", "OTP defiende su inversión y habla de problemas imprevisibles", "In a written statement to EFE, OTP says Ueno's appeal was its successful prior activity and neobank model, that its sub-10% stake gave no control or management rights and that the exposure is not material; Bencsik is quoted that there were problems that could not be foreseen.", "En una declaración escrita a EFE, OTP dice que el atractivo de Ueno era su exitosa actividad anterior y su modelo de neobanco, que su participación inferior al 10 % no le daba derechos de control ni de gestión y que la exposición no es material; se cita a Bencsik diciendo que hubo problemas que no se podían prever.", ["org:otp-bank", "person:laszlo-bencsik"], P("company", "src:efe-2026-11-19-otp", "body", "no le otorgaba derechos de control ni de gestión"))
E("2026-11-19", "supervisory", "BCP prepares packages of assets and deposits for transfer to other entities", "El BCP prepara paquetes de activos y depósitos para traspasar a otras entidades", "The BCP is analysing each asset and deposit to assemble packages for a competitive tender to other banks or finance companies; no transfer has taken place. Depositors complain of incomplete or delayed payments, blocked certificates of deposit and mutual funds, and pending cheques.", "El BCP analiza cada activo y depósito para armar paquetes a licitar de forma competitiva a otros bancos o financieras; aún no hubo traspaso. Depositantes reclaman pagos incompletos o demorados, CDA y fondos mutuos bloqueados y cheques pendientes.", [BCP, UB], P("press", "src:abc-2026-11-19-paquetes", "body", "", "high"))
E("2026-11-20", "criminal", "Judge authorises extraction of data from three phones of Peña; expert to be sworn in on 27 November", "El juez autoriza extraer datos de tres teléfonos de Peña; el perito jurará el 27 de noviembre", "Organised-crime judge Osmar Legal authorises the extraction of data from three iPhones for the period January 2023 to November 2026, designates a police expert to be sworn in on Friday 27 November 2026 at 09:30 and gives the parties 72 hours to propose experts.", "El juez de Crimen Organizado Osmar Legal autoriza la extracción de datos de tres iPhone por el período de enero de 2023 a noviembre de 2026, designa a un perito policial que jurará el viernes 27 de noviembre de 2026 a las 09:30 y da a las partes 72 horas para proponer peritos.", [PENA, "person:osmar-legal", MP], P("press", "src:ultimahora-2026-11-20-celulares", "body", "", "high", "The only future procedural date found in the pages opened."))
